<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohannisa Mishiraachcho</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohannisa Mishiraachcho</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohannisa Mishiraachcho</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohannisi Xaafida</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa Mishiraachcho Qaala</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohannisa Mishiraachcho qaalay Yesusi asho may7idi asa giddon beettida de7o Xoossa qaala gididayssa qonccisees. Hessika Aaway Godaa Xoossaa gidida mala, Yesusikka Godaa Xoossaa gididayssa bessees. Yoha 1:1; 8:58; 12:41; 20:28. Maxaafazi lo7eththi qonccisiza mala hayssi Mishiraachcho qaalay xaafettiday nababizayti Yesusi as ashshizaade gididi yaana geetettida Xoossa Naa gididayssa ammanana malanne asay iza ammanidi mernaa de7oy izan dizayssa erana malassa. (20:31)</para>
  <para style="ip">Mishiraachcho qaalazas koyro kifiley mernaas diza Xoossa qaalaynne Yesusi issino gididayssa koyro shiishshidaappe guye Yesusi as ashshizaade gididi yaana geetettida Xoossa Nay iza gididayssa bessiza dumma dumma malatatakka shiishshees. Hessafe qasse he malatatappe ay ayfey beettidaakko qonccisiza taariketi kaalleettes. Hayssi ha kifilezi issi issi asati Yesusan ammanidi iza kaallizayta gididayssanne hara asati qasse izara waani eqettidaakkonne izan nu ammanokko gizayssa yooteettes. Shempo 13-17 gakkanaas Yesusi oykettida omars bana kaallizaytara izas ay mala mino issifeteththi dizaakko izas kaqeteththa wodey matishin izi bana kaallizaytas giigsiza qaalanne minththeththiza qaala izi istta sissidayssa qoncciseettes. Hankko attida wurseththa shempoti qasse Yesusi oykettidayssa, pirdas shiiqidayssa, iza kaqeteththaa gishshassinne hayqoppe denththaa gishshas hessaththoka iza denththaafe guye bana kaallizaytas izi bana qonccisidayssa yooteettes.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohannisi Yesus Kirstoosa baggara beettiza mernaa de7o lo7eththi bessizay, Xoossa kiyateththi ha7ippe doommidi Yesusa, oge, tumanne de7o histti ammanon ekkizaytassa. Yohannisa Mishiraachcho qaala haratappe dummasizay ayana tumateth erisanaas keehi erettida asi hach hach go7ettiza miishshata heytikka haaththa, quma, poo7o, heemmizaade, dorsata, woyne miththinne woyne miththa ayfe misatizayta leemison yootizayssa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geloso <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqiza Yohannisanne Yesusa kaallida koyro tamaareta <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1:19-51</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesusi Xoossa ooso doommides <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2:1—12:50</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalaameninne he heeran Yesusas wurseththa ooso gallassata <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13:1—19:42</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hayqoppe Godaa denththinne iza qoncceth <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 20:1-31">20:1-31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Qaalay kase koyro dees. Qaalaykka Xoossa achchan dees. He qaalaykka Xoossa. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Izi koyro Xoossa achchan dees. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Medheteththi wuri izan medhettides. Medhettidaazan izi baynda medhettiday issinakka duukku. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />De7oy izan dawus; hanna de7oya asas poo7o. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Poo7oy dhuman poo7isees; dhumay poo7o mulekka xoonenna.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Xoossafe kiitettida Yohannisa geetettiza issaadey dees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mato 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-2">Luqa 3:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Iza markkateththan asi wuri ammanana mala Poo7os markka gidi yides. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Izi poo7o gishshas markkattana yides attiin izi ba hu7es poo7o gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />As ubbaas poo7o immiza tumu poo7oy hayssa ha alamezan yuussan dees.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Qaalaykka kase alamen dees; alameykka medhettiday izanna. Gido attiin alamey iza eribeenna. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Izi ba baggataakko yiin iza baggati iza ekkibeettenna. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Gido attiin iza ekkidayti iza sunththan ammanidayti istti Xoossa nayta gidana mala maata isttas immides. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Isttika Xoossa nayta gididay Xoossafe yelettida gishshas attiin asa zereththafe hessika asa wogan woykko asho shenen gidenna.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Qaalaykka as gidides; Xoossa kiyateththaninne tuman kumidi nunan aqides; issi naas aawaa matan diza bonchcho misatiza iza bonchcho nu be7idos.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohannisikka, «Taappe guyera yizayssi taappe aadhdhees. Gaasoykka izi taappe kasekka dees gaada ta inttes yootidayssi hekko hayssi izakko!» gi markkattides.<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Iza kumeththa kiyateththan nu wuri kiyateththa bolla kiyateth ekkidos. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Wogay Muse baggara imettides; kiyateththinne tumay gidikko Yesus Kirstoosa baggara nuus yides. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Xoos be7iday oonikka baa. Gido attiin Xoossa Aawa matan diza Xoossa Naa issoy xalala iza qonccisides.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqiza Yohannisa Markkateth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mato 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:15-17">Luqa 3:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Ayhudata daannati Yerusalaameppe qeesetanne Lewe nayta Yohannisakko kiittidi, «Ne oonee?» gi oychchishin,<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohannisi, «Tani Kirstoosa gidikke» giidi geeshshi markkattides attiin markkattanaas ixxibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Isttika, «Histtiin ne oonee? Ne Eelaasaa?» gi oychchida; izikka, «Gidikke» giidi isttas zaarides. Isttika, «Izi yaana geetettida nabey nenee?» gida. Izikka, «Akkay tana gidikke» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15-18">Zaare 18:15-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Istti qasse, «Histtiin ne oonee? Nuna kiittida asaas nu yootana mala ne nena oona gay?» gida. <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Izikka, «Nabe Isayaasi yootida mala tani, ‹Xoossa oge suurisite› gishe bazzo biittan waassizaade qaala giirissa» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Farsaawetappe kiitettida issi issi asati, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />hessa gishshas, «Ne Xoossi kiittidaade woykko buro yaana geetettida nabey nena gidonttaa gidikko histtiin aazas nuna xammaqay?» giidi iza oychchida.<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohannisikka isttas, «Ta haaththan xammaqays; gido attiin intte eronttaadey intte giddon eqqides. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Taappe guyera yaanayssi iza; ta iza caamma qasho birshanaas bessizaade gidikke» gides.<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Hayssi wuri haniday Yohannisi xammaqiza Yordaanoose shaafappe he pinththan diza Bitaaniya geetettiza katamanna.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dors</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Wonteththa gallas Yohannisi Yesusi baakko yishin be7idi, «Dere nagara biittafe diggana Xoossa dorsi hekko hayssich! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />‹Taappe guyera yaanayssi izi taappe kasekka diza gishshas taappe aadhdhees› gaada ta inttes yootizay hayssich! <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Tanikka ta baggara iza erabeekke; gidikkoka izi Isra7eele deres qonccana mala ta haaththan xammaqashe yadis» gides.<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Kaaleththidikka Yohannisi hizgi markkattides; «Xillo Ayanay haraphphe kafo misatidi saloppe wodhdhishininne iza bolla uttishin beyadis. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Ta ta baggara iza erikke shin ta haaththan xammaqana mala tana kiittidaadey, ‹Xillo Ayanay iza bolla wodhdhi shempishin ne beyanaadey Xillo Ayanan meeccanay iza› giidi taas yootides. <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Tanikka hessa beyadis. Hessa gishshas izi Xoossa naa gididayssa ta markkattays» gides.<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusa Koyro Kaallidayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Wonteththa gallas Yohannisi bana kaalliza nam7atara heen eqqides. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Yesusi iza achchara aadhdhishin Yohannisi be7idi, «Xoossa dorsi hekko hayssich!» gides.<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Yohannisa kaalliza nam7ati hessa siyidi Yesusa kaallida. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Istti iza kaallishin Yesusi guye yuuyi xeellidi, «Ay koyeetii?» gides. Isttika, «Astamaaree! Ne duussasoy awaa?» gida.<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Izikka istta, «Haa yiidi be7ite» gides; hessa gishshas biidi izi awan dizaakko be7idanne he gallas izara issife pe7ida; wodeykka gede tammu saateso bides.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Yohannisi yootida qaalaa siyidi Yesusa kaallida nam7atappe issoy Simoona Phexroosa isha Indiraasa. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Indiraasi koyro ba isha Simoonaakko biidi, «Xoossi kiittida Kirstoosa nu demmidos!» gides. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Hessafe guye Indiraasi Simoona Yesusaakko ekki bides.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesusikka iza tishshi histti xeellidi, «Haysso! Ne Yoona naa Simoona; hayssafe guye ne Keefa geetettana» gides. Keefa guussi Phexroosa guussa woykko zaalla shuch guussa.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Piliphoosanne Natina7eele Xeygides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Wonteththa gallas Yesusi Galila baanaas koyides. Piliphoosakka demmidi, «Tana kaalla» gides. <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Piliphoosikka Indiraasa malanne Phexroosa mala Betesayda katama asa. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Piliphoosi Natina7eele demmidi, «Musey woga maxaafan qasse nabetikka buroppe hananayssa yootiza ba maxaafatan iza gishshas xaafida addeza nu demmidos. Izikka Yooseefe naa Naazirete Yesusaakko!» gides.<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natina7eeley qasse, «Naazireteppe lo7o miishshi beetti erizee?» gi oychchiin Piliphoosi iza, «Haa yaada beya» gides. <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Natina7eeley Yesusa beyana yishin Yesusi be7idi iza, «Hekko! Geney baynda tumu Isra7eele asa!» giidi iza gishshas yootides.<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natina7eeleykka zaaridi, «Tana wostta eradii?» gi oychchiin Yesusikka, «Piliphoosi nena xeyganaappe kase balase miththa garsan ne dishin ta nena beyadis» gi zaarides. <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natina7eeley, «Astamaaree! Ne Xoossa naa; Ne Isra7eele kawo» gides.<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesusikka izas, «Ne ammaniday, ‹Ta nena balase miththa garsan beyadis› gida gishshee? Ne buro hessafe aadhdhiza daro miish beyana. <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Gujjidikka ta inttes tumu gays; buro saloy doyettiin Xoossa kiitanchchati Asa Naa bolla wodhdhishininne kezishin intte beyana» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Medhe 28:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Haaththe Woyne Ushshu Kessides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Heedzdzanththo gallas Galila giddon diza Qaana geetettiza kataman sargey dees; Yesusa aayeyakka heen dawus. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesusinne iza kaallizaytikka sargezaso xeygettida. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Sargezason woyneppe agettida ushshay wuriin Yesusa aaya Yesusa, «Woyne ushshay wurides» gadus. <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesusikka izo, «Aayee! Taas nenara aazi dizee? Ta wodey gakkibeenna» gides.<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />He wode Yesusa aayeya Maarama heen gadezan diza oosanchchata, «Izi inttena gizayssa ooththite» gadus. <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Ayhudatas geesho wogay diza gishshas shuchchafe medhettida usuppun baaththati heen deettes; isttika issoy issoy nam7u oto woykko heedzdzu oto haaththe oykkeettes. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesusi oosanchchata, «Baaththata haaththe kunththite» giin isttika baaththata doona gakkanaas siltti histti kunththida. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Hessafe guye oosanchchata, «Ane ha7i duuqqidi sargeza alaafezas izappe immite» gides. Isttika duuqqi duuqqi immida. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Alaafezikka woyne ushshan laamettida haaththaa ganxi xeellidi izi awappe yidaakko eribeenna. Haaththaa duuqqidayti gidikko ereettes; hessa gishshas sargeza alaafey mishiraza xeygidi, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />«Asi wuri sargeson koyro lo7o ushshu shiishshees; asay maththottidaappe guye iitaa ehees; gido attiin ne gidikko lo7o ushshu hanno gakkanaas woththaa gadasa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yesusi hessa malalisiza malata ubbaafe koyro Galila geetettiza deren Qaana kataman ooththides; ba bonchchoka hessa malan qonccisides; iza kaallizaytikka izan ammanida. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Hessafe guye Yesusi ba aayeyra ba ishataranne bana kaallizaytara duge Qifirnahoome wodhdhidi heen guuththa wode takkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mato 4:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Keeththan Zal7izayta Goodeteth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mato 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luqa 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Ayhudata Paaziga ba7aaley matida gishshas Yesusi Yerusalaame bides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kessa 12:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Xoossa Keeththa gibbe giddon boorata, dorsatanne haraphpheta bayzizayta qasseka miishshe laammizayti miishshe laammishin demmides. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Hessa be7idi wodoro xurqafe dooqqi ekkidi asaanne booratakka Xoossa Keeththa gibbefe kessides; miish laammizayta miishshaakka dharccidi istta xaraphpheezatakka shiri shiri yeggides.<verse eid="JHN 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Haraphphe bayziza asaakka, «Hayssa ubbaa gede diggite! Ta aawa keeththaa zal7e keeth histtofte» gides. <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />He wode iza kaallizayti, «Ne keeththa mishay tana tama mala xuuggees» geetetti xaafettida qaalaa qoppa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Maza 69:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Hessafe guye Ayhuda asaa halaqati Yesusa, «Ne hayssa wursa ooththanaas sheney nees dizayssa qonccisanaas ne nuna ay malalisiza malata bessanee?» gi oychchida.<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesusikka isttas, «Ane hayssa Xoossa Keeththaa laallite; ta iza heedzdzu gallassara zaara keexxana» gi zaarides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mato 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mar 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Isttika iza, «Hayssa Xoossa Keeththaa keexxanaas kase oyddu tammanne usuppun layth ekkides; histtiin neni heedzdzu gallassara keexxa kunththanee?» gi oychchida.<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Gido attiin Yesusi, «Xoossa Keeth» giday ba asateththaa gishshassa. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Hessa gishshas Yesusi hayqqi dendiin iza kaallizayti he yo7oza yuushshi qoppidi eridanne hayssa kase maxaafan xaafettidayssa Yesusi isttas kaseti yootida qaalaa ammanida.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Paaziga ba7aale gallas Yesusi Yerusalaamen dishe ooththida malaatata be7idi daro asay iza ammanides. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Qasse Yesusi asaa ubbaa eriza gishshas oonakka ammanibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Izi asa wozinan dizaa ubbaa eriza gishshas oonikka izas asa gishshas yootanaas koshshibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesusanne Niqodimoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Farsaaweta bagga as Ayhudata halaqatappe issi Niqodimoosa geetettiza asi dees. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Izi qamara Yesusaakko biidi, «Astamaaree! Xoossi izara dizaade gidikkofe attiin hayta ne ooththiza malalisiza malaatata ooththana dandayzaadey deenna; hessa gishshas neni Xoossa achchafe yida astamaare gididayssa nu eroos» gides.<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesusikka izas zaaridi, «Ta nees tumu gays; asi nam7anththo yelettontta aggiko Xoossa kawoteth beyanaas dandayenna» gides. <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Niqodimoosikka zaaridi, «Histtiin asi cimmidaappe guye waanidi nam7anththo yelettana dandayzee? Qasseka ba aayi ulon simmi gelidi yelettanee?» giidi oychchides.<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesusikka izas, «Ta nees tumu gays; asi haaththafenne Xillo Ayanappe yelettontta dishe Xoossa kawoteth gelanaas dandayenna. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Asappe yelettiday asa; Ayanappe yelettiday Ayana. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Hessa gishshas, ‹Intte nam7anththo yelettanaas koshshees› ta nena gida gishshas malalettofa. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Carkoy ba koyida bagga carkees; neni carkos giiris siyaasa attiin izi awappe yizaakkonne awa bizaakko erakka. Ayanappe yelettidaykka hessa mala» gides.<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Niqodimoosi, «Hayssi waani hanana dandayzee?» giidi oychchides. <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesusikka izas, «Isra7eele astamaare gida uttada hessa ne erkkii? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Ta nees tumu gays; nuni nu erizayssa yootoos. Nu be7idayssa markkattoos; gido attiin intte nu markkateth ekkeketa. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ta inttes hayssa ha biitta yo7o yootiin ammanontta ixxiko salo miish yootikko wostti intte ammananee? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Saloppe duge wodhdhida asa Naappe attiin pude salo keziday haray oonikka deenna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saloppe duge wodhdhida asa Naappe attiin pude salo keziday haray oonikka deenna gizayssa issi issi Geeshsha Maxaafati salon diza asa Naappe attiin geettes.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />«Bazzo biittan Musey shoosh dhoqqu histti kaqqidayssaththo hessaththoka Asa Nay dhoqqasohon kaqettanaas bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Tay 21:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />Hessika izan ammanizaadey wurikka mernaa de7o demmanaassa. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Xoossa Naa ammanizay wuri mernaa de7o demmanaappe attiin dhayontta mala Xoossi hayssa alameza daro siiqida gishshas ba mexi issi naaza immides. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Xoossi ba naaza duge alame kiittiday alame asay izan ammanidi attana malassa attiin izi alame asaa bolla pirdanaas gidenna.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />«Iza ammanizaade bolla pirdettenna. Iza ammanonttaadey gidikko Xoossa Naa issinezan ammanontta gishshas kasekka pirdetti uttides. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Pirdayka hayssa mala, poo7oy ha alame yides shin asaas oosoy iita gidida gishshas asay poo7oppe keehi dhuma dosides. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Iita ooththizaadey wurikka poo7o dosenna. Izi ooththiza iita oosoy qoncce kezontta mala izi ba hu7es poo7oy dizaso kezenna. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Tumu ooththizaadey gidikko poo7oy dizaso yees. Izi poo7oy dizaso yiza gaasoykka Xoossa azazo mala izi ooththida oosoy qonccana malassa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusanne Xammaqiza Yohannisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Hessafe guye Yesusi bana kaallizaytara Yuhuda dere bides; heenkka asaa xammaqishe isttara guuththa wode gam7ides. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />He wode Saalime achchan Henoone geetettizason daro Haaththi diza gishshas Yohannisi asaa xammaqishin asaykka izakko biidi xammaqettides. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />He wode Yohannisi buro qasho keeththe gelibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mato 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luqa 3:19-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />He wode Yohannisa kaallizayta giddoninne issi issi Ayhuda asata giddon Ayhudata geesho wogaa gishshas gita palamay dendides. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Yohannisa kaallizayti izakko shiiqidi, «Astamaaree! Nenara Yordaanoose shaafa pinththan issife dishin ne iza gishshas markkatto addezi hekko xammaqees; asaykka izakko bees» gida. <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohannisikka isttas, «Oonaska Xoossafe imettontta dishin aykkoyka daana dandayenna.<verse eid="JHN 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />«Tani izappe sinththata kiitettadis attiin yaana gida Kirstoosi tana gidikke» gaada ta inttes yootoyssas intte intte hu7era ta markkatta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yoha 1:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Sarge wode ekkana mishiray dizaadey izikka mishira; mishira laggey gidikko mishiraza achchan eqqidi mishirazi gizaaz siyees; mishiraza qaala siyidi ufayettees; hessa gishshas ta ufayssi ha7i polettides. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Izi dhoqqu dhoqqu gaana mala tanikka ziqqi ziqqi gaana koshshees.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />«Bollafe yizaadey ubbaafe bolla; garsa biittafe yizaadey izi biittafenne biittaaz yootees; Saloppe yizaadey izi ubbaafe bolla. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Izi ba be7idaazinne ba siyidaaz markkattees; gido attiin iza markkateth ekkizaadey deenna. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Iza markkateth ekkizaadey gidikko Xoossa tumanchcha gididayssa qonccisees. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Xoossi kiittidaadey Xoossa qaala yootees. Xoossika izaades ba Ayana makki immenna.<verse eid="JHN 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />«Aaway ba naa dosees. Haniza yo7o ubbaa iza kushen aaththi immees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mato 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luqa 10:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Naazan ammanizaades mernaa de7oy dees. Naazan ammanonttay gidikko Xoossa hanqoy iza bolla daana attiin de7o demmenna» gides.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />He wode Yesusi Yohannisappe bollara daro asa bana kaallizaade ooththizayssanne xammaqizayssa Farsaaweti siyida. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Gido attiin xammaqizayti iza kaallizaytappe attiin izi xammaqibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Iza gishshas haasayettizayssa Farsaaweti siyidayssa Yesusi eridi Yuhuda dere aggidi Galila dere simmi bides. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Izi hee bishin Samaariyara aadhdhi baanayssi izas attonttaaz gidides.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Hessa gishshas Sikaaro geetettizaso Samaariya katama bides. Sikaara Yaaqoobey ba naa Yooseefes immida biittaa achchan dawus.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Medhe 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iya 24:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Heenkka Yaaqoobe haaththa ollay dees. Yesusi oge hemetti daaburda gishshas he ollay achchan uttides. Wodeykka gallassafe usuppun saate mala.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />He wode issi Samaariya dere maccas dizaara haaththe duuqqanaas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Duuqqanaas: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Duuqqanaas gizayssa issi issi bagga Gamoththo qaalan Tikkanaas geettes.</char></note> he haaththaa ollaako yadus. Yesusikka izo, «Tana haaththe ushsha» gides. <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Hessi hanishin Yesusa kaallizayti quma shammana katama bida. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Hinna Samaariya maccassaya Yesusa, «Ne Ayhuda as gida uttada waanada tana Samaariya maccas, ‹Haaththe ushsha› ga oychchay?» gadus; iza hessa giday Ayhuda asaassinne Samaariya asas gaagoteththi dontta gishshassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:1-5">Hizi 4:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 4:1-2">Iya 4:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesusikka izis, «Xoossa imotaynne nena, ‹Tana haaththe ushsha› gizaadey izi oonakkonne ne erizaakko ne iza woossanaas bessees. Izikka nees de7o haaththe immanakkoshin» gides. <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Izakka izas, «Godoo! Nees haaththe duuqqiza miishshi deenna; haaththaa ollayka daro ciimma; histtiin ne de7o haath awappe demmanee? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Ne hayssa haaththa ollaza nuus immida nu aawaa Yaaqoobeppe aadhdhay? Izinne iza nayti iza mehetikka hayssa ha ollaafe haath uyida» gadus.<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesusi izis, «Hayssa ha haaththaafe uyizay wuri nam7anththo saamettidi zaari hara uyanashin. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Ta immiza haaththe uyizaadey gidikko mernaas mulekka saamettenna; gaasoykka ta immiza haath uyizaades mernaa de7os pulttiza pultto haaththe gidana» gides.<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Maccassayakka, «Godoo! Hayssafe guye tana haaththi saamontta malanne qasseka ta haaththe duuqqana haa yontta mala hessa ne giza haaththaa mala haaththe taas immarkkii?» gadus. <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesusikka izo, «Baada ne azinaa xeyga ekkada ya» gides. <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Maccassayakka zaarada, «Taas azinay deenna» gadus; iza hizgiin Yesusi, « ‹Ne taas azinay deenna› guussay tumukko. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Gaasoykka kase nees ichchashu azinati deettes; qasse ha7i nenara dizayssi ne azina gidenna; hessa gishshas ne tumu gadasa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Maccassaya izas, «Godoo! Neni nabe gididayssa ta ha7i eradis. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Kase nu Aawati hayssa zumaa bolla goynnida; intte qasse, ‹Asay goynnanaas bessizasoy Yerusalaamenkko!› geeta» gadus.<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesusikka izis, «Hanne maccassayee, Xoossaa aawaas hayssa zumaa bolla woykko Yerusalaamen intte goynnontta wodey yaanayssa ammana. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Intte intte erontta Xoossas goynneeta; nu gidikko asas atoteththi Ayhudappe gidida gishshas nuni nu eriza Xoossas goynnoos. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Gido attiin tumu goynnizayti Xoossaa Aawaas Ayananinne tuman goynniza wodey buro yaana; haray attoshin ha7ikka yides. Xoossay aawaykka koyzay hessa mala goynnizayta. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Xoossi ba hu7es Ayana; iza goynnizayti ayananinne tuman goynnanaas bessees» gides.<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Maccassayakka, «Kirstoosi yaanayssa ta erays; izi yiidi hanizaaz ubbaa nuus yootana» gadus. <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesusikka izis, «Ha7i nenara haasayzay ta iza» gides.<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Hessi hanishin iza kaallizayti ba bidasoppe simmida. Yesusi Maccassara haasayzayssa malalettida; gido attiin, «Hanne ay koyay? Woykko hannira aazas haasayay?» giidi oonikka oychchibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Hessafe guye maccassaya otoza heen aggaagada gede katama baada asaas, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />«Ta ooththidaaz wursi taas yootidaade haa yiidi be7ite; oonee erizay Xoossi tiyda Kirstoosi izakkonnee!» gadus.<verse eid="JHN 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Asaykka katamaappe kezidi Yesusaakko bides. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />He wode Yesusa kaallizayti Yesusa, «Astamaaree! Quma ma» giidi woossida. <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Izi qasse, «Intte eronttay ta miza qumay taas dees» gides.<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Hessa gishshas iza kaallizayti, «Aykko miza kath asi izas ehideeshaa?» giidi ba giddon haasayettida <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesusikka isttas zaaridi, «Ta qumay tana kiittida ta Aawaa shene oosonne iza ooso polo. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Intte qasse, ‹Kaththa maxay gakkanaas buro oyddu aginay attides› geeta gidekketii? Qasse tani gidikko inttena, ‹Dhoqqu giidi kaththay maxa gakkidayssa xeellite› gays. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Maxizaadey ba damoza ekkana; mernaas gidiza ayfe shiishshana; hessa gishshas zerizaadeynne maxizaadey issife ufayettana. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Hessa gishshas issaadey zerana; hara asi maxana geetettiza leemisoy tuma. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Ta inttena intte daaburonttayssa maxana mala yeddadis; harati ooson daaburda; gido attiin intte istta daabursan go7ettideta» gides.<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Maccassaya, «Ta ooththidaaz ubbaa taas izi yootides» gaada asaas markkattida mala katamaappe daro Samaariya asay izan ammanides. <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Hessa gishshas Samaariya asay Yesusaakko yiidi izi isttakon gam7ana mala woossides; izikka nam7u gallas heen gam7ides. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Iza qaalaa siyidi daro asay iza ammanides. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Maccassayokka, «Ha7i nu iza ammanizay ne yootida qaalaa gishshas xalla gidontta nunikka nu baggara izappe siyida gishshassinne tumappe izi dere ashshizaade gididayssa erida gishshassa» gida.<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Shuumeza Naaza Paththides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Yesusi Samaariyan nam7u gallas gam7idaappe guye Galila bides. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Izi ba baggara, «Nabey ba deren bonchchettenna» gi yootides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mato 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mar 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luqa 4:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Gido attiin izi Galila biin Galila asay iza lo7eththi mokki ekkides; gaasoykka Paaziga ba7aale bonchchana Yerusalaame bidason heen dishin izi ooththidayssa wursi be7ida gishshassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Yoha 2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Hessafe guye Yesusi haaththe woyne cajje ooththida Galila dere giddon diza Qaana geetettiza katamaa nam7anththo bides. He wode Qifirnahoomen izas nay sakettida issi kawo shuumey dees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Yoha 2:1-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Izikka Yesusi Yuhuda dereppe gede Galila yidayssa siyidi Yesusaakko bides. Yesusi duge Qifirnahoome wodhdhana malanne daro sakettidi hayqqana giza naaza paththana mala Yesusa woossides. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesusikka izas, «Intte gita malaatatanne malalisizaaz be7ontta aykkoka ammanekketa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Shuumezikka zaaridi, «Godoo! Ta naazi hayqqontta elela wodhdharkkii!» gides. <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesusikka iza, «Neni neso ba! Naazi paxides» gides; addezikka Yesusi izas yootida qaalaa ammanidi soo simmi bides. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Izi soo bishin iza ashkarati izara ogen gaaggidi, «Ne naazi paxides» giidi izas yootida.<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Shuumezikka naazi ay saaten paxidaakko istta zaari oychchides. Isttika izas, «Qamma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:52 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Qamma: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Qamma gizayssa issi issi bagga Gamoththo qaalan zine geettes.</char></note> gallassafe laappun saaten iza michchizayssi aggides» gida. <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Naaza aawaykka Yesusi, «Ne naazi paxides» giday he istti izas yootiza wode gididayssa erides. Hessa gishshas he gallassafe oykkidi izinne izaso asay wuri Yesusa ammanida.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Hayssi malatay Yesusi Yuhudappe Galila yiidi ooththida nam7anththo malata.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Paththida Toho Sila Addeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Hessafe kaallidi Ayhudata ba7aaley diza gishshas Yesusi Yerusalaame bides. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Yerusalaamen dorsi geliza penge achchan Ibraaweta qaalara, «Betesayda»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Betesayda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Betesayda issi issi Geeshsha Maxaafati, «Betezata» geettes; birsheththayka, «Maaroteththa keeththa» guussa.</char></note> geetettiza issi pulttofe shiiqidi eellida haaththi dees; izappe bollara kamay diza ichchashu ogeti deettes. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Daro harganchchati, ayfe qooqeti, toho wobbetinne toho silati oge bolla ichchidi haaththi qaaxettana gakkanaas naageettes. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Issi issi wode Godaa kiitanchchay haaththaan wodhdhidi haaththa qaaththees; haaththaa qaaththafe kaallidi koyrottidi haaththaan geliza harganchchay bana sakkiza ay hargefekka paxees.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi Geeshsha Maxaafati taybo heedzdzas wurseththa bollafe biidi oyddu wurseth gakkanaas diza qofaa gujjettenna.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Heen heedzdzu tammanne osppun layth kumeth sakettida issaadey dees. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesusi addezi heen ichchidayssa be7idinne izi daro layth sakettidayssa eridi, «Ne paxana koyay?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Harganchchazikka zaaridi, «Godoo! Haaththay qaaxettiza wode tana haaththaan gelththiza asi deenna; ta buro baana gishin haray taappe kaseti haaththaan gelees» gides. <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesusikka iza, «Denda! Ne ichchida algaa tookkada ba!» gides.<verse eid="JHN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Addezikka heerakka paxides; ba algaa tookki ekkidi bides. Hessi haniday Ayhudata Sambata gallassa. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Hessa gishshas Ayhudata halaqati paxida addeza, «Hach Sambatara ne algaa tookkana mala Muse wogay azazenna» gida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Nahi 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Er 17:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Izikka isttas, « ‹Ne ichchida algaa tookkada ba› gi yootides» gides. <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Isttika, «Nena algaa tookkada ba giday oonee?» gi oychchida. <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Derey darida gishshassinne Yesusi heeppe haakki bida gishshas iza ooni paththidaakko addezi eribeenna.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Hessafe guye Yesusi addeza Xoossa Keeththan demmidi, «Hekko ha7i ne paxadasa; kaseyssafe aadhdhiza iita miishshi ne bolla gakkontta mala nagara nam7anththo ooththofa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Addezikka biidinne iza paththiday Yesusa gididayssa Ayhudata halaqatas yootides. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Addeza Sambata gallas paththida gishshas Ayhudata daannati Yesusa oykkana yedeththida. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesusikka isttas, «Ta Aaway ubba wode ooththees; tanikka ooththana» gides; <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Hessa gaason Ayhudata daannati Yesusa wodhana mala kaseppe aaththi denththeththida. Qasse izi Sambata moorida gishshas xalla gidontta, «Xoossi ta Aawa» gida gishshassinne bana Xoossara ginisida gishshassa.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Naa Godateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesusi isttas, «Ta inttes tumu gays; Aaway ooththishin be7idayssa oosoppe attiin naazi ba shenen aykkoka ooththenna. Aaway ooththizayssa iza nay hessaththoka ooththees. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Gaasoykka Aaway naaza dosees. Ba ooththizayssaka wursi iza bessees; intte malalettana mala hayssafekka aadhdhiza ooso buro bessana. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Aaway hayqqidayta denththizayssaththonne de7o immizayssaththo naazikka hessaththo ba koyidaades de7o immana. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Aaway oona bollaka pirdenna; gido attiin pirda maata ubbaa ba naazas immides. <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />Izi hessaththo ooththiday asay wuri Aawa bonchchana malanne qasseka naazakka bonchchana malassa. Naaza bonchchonttay naaza kiittida Aawaakka bonchchenna.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />«Ta inttes tuma gays; ta qaalaa siyizaadessinne tana kiittidaaden ammanizaades mernaa de7oy dees. Izaadey hayqoppe gede de7on pinnides attiin iza bolla pirdettenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Ta inttes tuma gays; kase hayqqida asati Xoossa naa qaala siyiza wodey yaana; he wodeyakka hanno; siyizayti wuri de7on daana. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Gaasoykka Aaway ba baggara de7oy diza mala naazikka ba baggara de7oy daana mala ooththides. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Izi asa naa gidida gishshas pirdana mala godateth izas immides. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Hayssan aykkoka malalettofte. Gaasoykka kase hayqqidi duufon dizayti wuri iza qaala giiris siyiza wodey yaana. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />Lo7o ooththidayti hayqoppe dendidi paxana. Gido attiin iita ooththidayti hayqoppe dendidi pirdettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Daane 12:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusas Markkattida Asata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />«Tani ta shenen aykkoka ooththanaas dandaykke; gido attiin ta aawappe ta siyida mala pirdays. Tana kiittidayssa shene ooththays attiin ta shenen ta ooththontta gishshas ta pirdan balay baa. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Tani ta gishshas tarkka markkattiko ta markkay tumu gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Gido attiin ta gishshas markkattizaadey haray dees; izikka ta gishshas markkattizaade markkateththay tumu gididayssa ta erays. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Intte Yohannisakko ase kiittideta shin izikka tumu markkattides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-27">Yoha 1:19-27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:27-30">3:27-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Ta hayssa gizay intte attana mala attiin taas hara markkateth koshshida gishshas gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohannisi eexxidi poo7isiza poo7o mala. Intteka guuththa wode iza poo7on ufayettana koyideta. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Taas gidikko Yohannisa markkateththafe aadhdhiza markkay dees. Ta markkayka ta Aaway taas immida ooso. Hessika ta ooththiza oosoy ta Aaway tana kiittidayssa taas markkattees. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Tana kiittida ta Aawaykka ba hu7era taas markkattides. Intte gidikko iza qaala giiris mulekka siyibeekketa; izas medhaakka mulera beyibeekketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mato 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luqa 3:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Izi kiittidaaden intte ammanontta gishshas iza qaalay intte achchan deenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Inttes Geeshsha Maxaafatappe mernaa de7o demmanaas misatiin maxaafata pilggeeta; maxaafatikka ta gishshas markkatteettes. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Gido attiin intte de7o demmanaas taakko ha yaana koyekketa.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />«Tani asappe bonchcho koykke. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Ta inttena erays; Xoossa siiqoy inttenan bayndayssaka erays. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Tani ta Aawa sunththan yadis shin intte tana mokki ekkibeekketa. Hara asi qasse ba sunththan yiikko intte iza mokki ekkeeta. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Intte intte giddon issoy issaafe bonchcho koyzaytoo! Issi Xoossafe beettiza bonchcho koyonttayto intte waanidi tana ammanana dandayeetii? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Ta Aawa sinththan inttena mootanay inttes tana misatoppo; inttena mootanay intte iza hidota ooththiza Muse. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Musey ta gishshas xaafidayssa ammanidaakko intte tana ammanana. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Izi xaafidayssa intte ammanontta aggiko qasse ta qaala intte waani ammananee?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Mizida Ichchashu Shii Asaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mato 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luqa 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Hessafe guye Yesusi Xibiraadoose geetettizaso Galila abbafe he pinth pinnides. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Yesusi harganchchata paththida malaata be7ida gishshas daro asay iza kaallides. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesusi bana kaallizaytara pude zuma bolla kezi uttides. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />He wode Ayhudata Paaziga ba7aaley mati uttides. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />He wode daro derey izakko yizayssa Yesusi dhoqqu gi xeellidi Piliphoosa, «Hayssa deraas gidana quma awappe shammana dandayzonii?» gides. <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yesusi Piliphoosa hessaththo oychchiday iza paaccanaas giidippe attiin izi ba ooththanayssa erees.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Piliphoosikka izas, «Issaades issaades issi bars gidiza kath shammizaakkoka nam7u xeetu dinaaren shammida kaththika hayssas gidenna» gides. <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Yesusa kaallizaytappe issoy Simoona Phexroosa isha Indiraasi, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />«Ichchashu bangga ukeththinne nam7u mole oykkida issi nay hayssan dees. Gido attiin hanna hayssa ha derezas ay gidanee?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesusikka zaaridi, «Asaa ubbaa utisite» gides; heen daro maatay diza gishshas asay uttides; asaa qoodaykka ichchashu shii gidizaaza. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Hessafe guye Yesusi ukeththaa ekkidi galata woosa woossidi uttida asaas gishides. Molezakka hessaththoka gishechchides. Asay wurikka baas gidizaaz demmides. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Asay wurikka kalli miin Yesusi bana kaallizayta, «Maaddan attida kaththaa issinokka ashshontta shiishshite» gides. <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Isttika asay mishin ichchashu ukeththaafe attida tammanne nam7u leemate kumeth shiishshida.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Asatikka Yesusi ooththida malaataa be7idi, «Hayssaadey tumappe ha alame yaana nabezakko!» gida. <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Asay qasse wolqqara Yesusa kawoththana qoppidayssa eridi Yesusi qasseka isttafe haakki biidi zuma bolla kezides.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abba Bollara Yesusa Hemeth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-27">Mato 14:22-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Gadey qammishin Yesusa kaallizayti duge abbaako wodhdhida. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Wogolon gelidi Qifirnahoome baana kezida. Istti kezishin gadey dhumides. Yesusi hessa gakkanaaska isttako yibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Wolqqama carkoy carkiza gishshas abbay keehi qaaxxides. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Iza kaallizayti bagga saate oge mala wogoloza laaggidaappe guye Yesusi abbaa bollara tohora hemetti wogolozaakko matishin demmidi babbida. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Izikka isttas, «Tanakko! Babbofte!» gides. <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Isttika iza ufayssara gede wogoloza giddo ekkana koyida. Heerakka wogolozikka istti baanaaso gakkides.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Asas De7o Quma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Abbaafe he pinththan attida asay wonteththa gallas abbaa bolla issi wogoloy xalla dizaaro be7ides. Yesusa kaallizayti kase barkka bidayssanne Yesusi isttara wogolon gelonttayssa erida. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Gido attiin hankko wogoloti Xibiraadooseppe dendidi Yesusi galata woosa woossiin asay kath midaso yida. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Asatikka Yesusi woykko iza kaallizayti heen bayndayssa be7idi he wogolotan gelidi Yesusa kosh Qifirnahoome bida. <verse eid="JHN 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Abbaafe he pinththan iza demmidi, «Astamaaree! Ne ayde hayssa yadii?» gida.<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesusikka isttas, «Ta inttes tuma gays; intte tana koyzay kath mi kaallida gishshas attiin malata be7ida gishshas gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Dhayana kaththas ooththofte. Gido attiin hessafe aaththidi Xoossay aaway ammanththiza maatame iza bolla shocida gishshas Asa Nay inttes immiza mernaa de7os gidiza kaththas ooththite» gides. <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Isttika izas, «Histtiin Xoossa ooso ooththanaas nu ay ooththinoo?» gida. <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesusikka, «Xoossa oosoy Xoossi kiittida iza naazan ammano» giidi isttas zaarides.<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Isttika izas, «Nu be7idi nena ammanana mala ne nuna ay malaata bessanee? Qasseka ay ooththanee? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />‹Istti maana mala isttas quma saloppe immides› geetetti xaafettida mala kase nu aawati bazzo biittan manna geetettiza kath mida» gida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Kessa 16:4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Maza 78:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesusi isttas, «Ta inttes tumu gays; saloppe wodhdhida quma inttes immiday Muse gidenna. Tumu quma saloppe inttes immizay ta Aawaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Gaasoykka Xoossa qumay saloppe wodhdhidi alames de7o immizayssa» gides. <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Hessa gishshas asay, «Godoo, hessa mala quma nuus ubba wode immarkkii!» gides.<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesusikka isttas, «De7o qumay tana; taakko yiza asi mulekka gafettenna; tana ammanizaadey aydekka saamettenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Kase ta inttes gida mala intte tana beyideta shin ammanibeekketa. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Ta Aaway taas immizay wurikka taakko yaana; taakko yizaade ta kare gooddike. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Gaasoykka tani saloppe wodhdhiday tana kiittidayssa shene ooththanaas attiin ta shene ooththanaas gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Tana kiittidayssa sheney taas immidaytappe issaadeka dhayssontta wurseththa gallas ta denththana. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Ee ta sheney naaza be7idi iza ammanizaadey wuri mernaa de7o demmanaassa. Tanikka wurseththa gallas iza hayqoppe denththana» gides. <verse eid="JHN 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Hessa gishshas Yesusi, «Saloppe wodhdhida qumay tana» gida gishshas Ayhudati iza bolla zuuzumettida. <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />«Hayssi Yooseefe naa Yesusa gidennee? Iza aawaanne iza aayo nu erokkonii? Histtiin ha7i izi, ‹Saloppe wodhdhadis› waani gizee?» gida.<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesusikka isttas, «Intte intte giddon zuuzumeeta. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Tana kiittida ta Aaway xeygidaadefe attiin taakko yaana dandayzaadey oonikka deenna. Barkka taakko yaana dandayzay oonikka deenna; taakko yizaadeka wurseththa gallas ta iza hayqoppe denththana. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Nabeta maxaafatan asay wuri Xoossafe tamaardaade gidana geetetti xaafettides. Hessa gishshas Aawappe siyidi tamaarda asi wuri taakko yaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa 54:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Hessa guussi Aawaa be7ida asi dees guus gidenna; Aawaa be7iday Xoossa achchafe yidayssa xalla. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Ta inttes tuma gays; tanan ammanida asas mernaa de7oy dees. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Tani de7o quma. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Kase intte aawati bazzo biittan manna mida; gido attiin wurikka hayqqida. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Saloppe wodhdhida qumay hayssa; hayssa mizaadey mulekka hayqqenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Saloppe wodhdhida de7o qumay tana; hayssa ha qumaappe mizaadey wurikka mernaas daana. Alames de7o gidana mala ta immiza qumay ta ashoza» gides.<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />He wode Ayhudati, «Hayssi addezi nu iza asho maana mala izi nuus wostti immanee?» giidi ba giddon palamettida. <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Hessa gishshas Yesusi istta, «Ta inttes tumu gays; Asa Naa asho intte montta aggiko, iza suuththika uyontta aggiko inttes de7oy deenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Ta asho mizaadessinne ta suuth uyizaades ubbaas mernaa de7oy dees; tanikka izaade wurseththa gallas hayqoppe denththana. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Gaasoykka ta ashoy tumu quma; ta suuththika tumu ushsha. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Ta asho mizaynne ta suuth uyizay wuri tanan daana; tanikka izaaden daana. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />De7o Aaway tana kiittida malanne tanikka izan de7on diza mala hessaththoka ta asho mizaadey wuri tanan de7on daana. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Hessa gishshas saloppe wodhdhida qumay hayssa; izikka kase intte aawati midayssa mala gidenna. Gaasoykka he qumaa midayti hayqqida; ha qumaa mizayti gidikko mernaas daana» gides. <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesusi hayssa Qifirnahoomen Ayhudata Woosa Keeththan tamaarsiza wode yootides.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mernaa De7o Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Iza kaallizaytappe darizayti hessa siyidi, «Hayssi yo7ozi deexo; hayssa ooni ekkana dandayzee?» gida. <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesusikka iza kaallizayti hessa yo7oza gishshas zuuzumettidayssa ba wozinan eridi, «Hayssi inttena deexxizee? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Asa Nay Kirstoosi ba dizaso simmi kezishin beykko intte ay gaanee? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Asas de7o immizay Xoossa Ayanakko! Asa wolqqay qasse aykkoka go7enna; ta inttes yootida qaalay de7o immiza ayana. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Gido attiin intte giddon issi issi ammanontta asati deettes» gides. Yesusi isttas hessa giday koyroppe doommidi istta giddon ammanonttayti oonanttako qasse iza aaththi immanaadeyka oonakko eriza gishshassa. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Kaaleththidikka Yesusi, «Aawaa sheney baynda taakko haa yaana dandayzaadey deenna gaada ta inttes yootiday hessassa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Hessafe dendidayssan iza kaallizaytappe daroti guye simmida. He gallassafe doommidi Yesusa kaalo aggida. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Hessa gishshas Yesusi bana kaalliza tammanne nam7ata, «Intteka baana koyeetii?» gides. <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />He wode Simoona geetettiza Phexroosi, «Godoo, nees mernaa de7o qaalay dishin nu oonakko baanee? <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Ne geeshsha Xoossa naa gididayssa eridi nuni ammanidos» gides. <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesusikka isttas, «Ta inttena tammanne nam7ata doorabeekkinaa? Histtiin inttefe issoy Xala7e» gides. <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Izi hessa giday Simoona naa Asqoronto Yuhuda gishshassa. Ays giikko Yuhuday tammanne nam7atappe issaa gidikkoka Yesusa aaththi immanay iza gidida gishshassa.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Daase Ba7aales Yerusalaame Yesusa Buus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Hessafe guye Yesusi Galila giddon yuuyettides; gido attiin Yuhudan yuuyanaas koyibeenna. Gaasoykka Ayhudati iza wodhdhana koyza gishshassa. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />He wode Ayhudata daase ba7aaley mati uttides. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Hessa gishshas Yesusa ishati izakko shiiqidi, «Nena kaallizayti ne ooththiza oosoza beyana mala ne hayssafe dendada Yuhuda dere ba. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Gaasoykka qonccen erettana koyzaadey ba ooso geeman ooththenna. Nekka haytantta wursa ooththashe nena alamen qonccisana koshshees» gida. <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Istti hessa gida gaasoykka iza ishatakka gidiin izan ammanonttayta gidida gishshassa.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesusikka isttas, «Ta wodey buro gakkibeenna; intte wodey gidikko ubba wode inttes giigakko. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Derey inttena ixxana dandayenna; tana gidikko ixxees; gaasoykka tani alame oosoy iita gididayssa izas markkattiza gishshassa. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Ha7i intte ba7aalezaso biite; taas wodey gakkontta gishshas hayssa ha ba7aalezaso ta biikke» gides. <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Hessa giidi Yesusi Galilan attides.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daase Ba7aaleson Yesusa Beeto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Gido attiin iza ishati ba7aalezaso bidaappe guye Yesusi qonccera gidontta qotara ba7aalezaso bides. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Ayhudati, «Izi awan dizee?» gishe ba7aalezason koyida. <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Dereykka iza gishshas garsara saasuki haasayettides. Issi issi asati, «Izi lo7o asa» gishin baggay qasse, «Lo7o gidenna; izi dere baleththees» gida. <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Gido attiin Ayhudata daannatas babbiza gishshas oonikka iza gishshas qonccen haasaybeenna.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ba7aalezi wurana bagga gakkishin Yesusi Xoossa Keeththe biidi tamaarso oykkides. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Ayhudati, «Hayssi addezi tamaarontta dishe hayssa wursi wostti eridee?» giidi malalettida.<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Hessa gishshas Yesusi, «Ta tamaarsiza timirtey tana kiittida ta Aawappe taas imettides attiin taappe gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Tana kiittidayssa shene ooththana koyzaadey diikko hayssi ha timirtey Xoossafe beettidayssa woykko ta taappe haasaydayssa gidikkoka erana. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Baappe haasayzaadey ba bonchcho koyees. Kiittidaade bonchcho koyzaadey gidikko izi tumanchcha; wordoy iza bolla deenna. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Musey inttes woga immides gidennee? Gidikkoka intte giddon woga naagi polidaadey oonikka deenna. Intte aazas tana wodhana koyeetii?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Dereykka iza, «Ne bolla daydanththi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Daydanth: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daydanth guussi Xala7e oosanchchata guussa.</char></note> dees! Nena wodhana koyzay oonee?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesusikka isttas, «Ta issi ooso ooththadis; intte wurikka hanno ha oosoyn malaletteeta. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musey inttes qaxxara woga immides; he wogaykka imettiday kase aawatappe beettides attiin Museppe gidenna. Histtiin hekko intteka Sambata gallassika as qaxxareeta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lewe 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:10">Medhe 17:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Histtiko Muse wogay shaarettontta mala asi Sambata gallas qaxxarettizaaz gidikko histtiin ta Sambata gallas asaas kumeththa asateth paththiin aazas ta bolla hanqetteetii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Yoha 5:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Suure pirda pirdite attiin asa ayfeso xeellidi maado pirda pirdofte» gi zaarides.<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirstoosa Gishshas Dendida Palama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Yerusalaame asaappe issi issi asati, «Istti wodhana koyza addezi hayssa gidennee? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Hekko izi qonccen haasayees shin istti iza aykkoka gibeettenna. Hayssi Xoossi kiittidaade gididayssa daannati tumu erizoshaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Histtiin hayssi addezi awa asakko nu eroos. Xoossi kiittidaadey yishin qasse izi awappeko erizaadey oonikka deenna» gida. <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Hessa gishshas Yesusi Xoossa Keeththan tamaarsishe ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi, «Intte tana tumu ereeta; ta awappe yidaakko intte ereeta. Qasse tani ta shenen yabeekke; tana kiittidayssi izi tumanchcha; gido attiin intte qasse iza erekketa. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Ta gidikko iza achchafe yida gishshassinne izi tana kiittida gishshas ta iza erays» gides. <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />He wode iza oykkanaas koyida; gido attiin buro wodey gakkibeenna gishshas oonikka iza oykkibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Gidikkoka derezappe daroy izan ammanides; asay, «Xoossi kiittidaadey yiza wode hayssi addezi ooththoo malaatappe bollara hara ooththanee?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusa Oykkana Wottadarata Kiiteteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Asay Yesusa gishshas garsara saasuketti haasayettishin Farsaaweti siyida. Hessa gishshas qeeseta halaqatinne Farsaaweti Yesusa oykkanaas Xoossa Keeththa penge naagizayta yeddida. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />He wode Yesusi, «Ta inttenara guuththa wode daashshana; hessafe guye tana kiittidayssako ta simma baana. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Intte tana koyana shin demmeketa; intte ta dizaso yaanaas dandayekketa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Hessa gishshas Ayhudata daannati ba giddon issoy issaara, «Hayssi addezi nu demmontta mala awa baaneesha? Oonee erizay Giriketa giddon laaletti diza Ayhudatakko biidi Giriketa tamaarsaneeshaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Izi, ‹Intte tana koyana shin demmeketa; ta dizaso intte yaanaas dandayekketa› gishin hessi ay guussee?» gida.<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">De7o Haath</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Gita ba7aaleza wurseththa gallas Yesusi dendi eqqidi ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi, «Haath saamettidaadey diikko haa taakko yiidi uyo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lewe 23:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Geeshsha Maxaafay gida mala tana ammanizaadefe de7o haaththa pulttoy pulttana» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Hizi 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zaka 14:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Izi hessa giday izan ammanizayti buroppe ekkana Xillo Ayana gishshassa; gaasoykka Yesusi bonchchettiza wodey buro gakkontta gishshas Xillo Ayanay imettibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dereza Giddon Medhettida Shaaketeth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Hessa gishshas derezappe issi issi asati he qaalaa siyidi, «Yaana giza nabey tumappe hayssa» gida. <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Harati, «Hayssi Xoossi kiittidaade» gida; baggayti qasse, «Xoossi kiittidaadey Galilappe waani yaanee? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Xoossi kiittidaadey Dawite zereththafe yelettanayssanne Dawite katama Beeteliheemeppe yaanayssi kase Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettibeennee?» gida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2Same 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Miki 5:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Hessa gishshas iza gaason derey ba giddon shaaketti wodhdhides. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Isttafe issi issi asati iza oykkana koyida; gido attiin oonikka iza oykkibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayhudata Daannati Ammanibeettenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Hessafe guye Xoossa Keeththe naagizayti qeeseta halaqataakkonne Farsaawetakko simmi bida. Isttika, «Aazas iza ekkontta yidetii?» gida. <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Wottadaratikka zaaridi, «Ha addezi haasayzayssa mala ay asikka haasayi erenna» gida.<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Farsaaweti istta, «Intteka balettidetii? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Daannatappe woykko Farsaawetappe iza ammanidayti dizooshaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Hayssi Muse wogaa erontta derey tumappe qanggettidayssa» gida.<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Hayssafe kase Yesusaakko bida Farsaawetappe issaa gidida Niqodimoosi isttas,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Yoha 3:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />«Nu wogan issi mootettizaadey ba mootos zaaro immiin siyonttanne izi ay ooththidaakko erettontta dishin pirday pirdetti erizee?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Isttika, «Nekka Galila asee? Galilappe nabey dendonttayssa pilggada gakka era» gida. <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Hessafe guye issoy issoy baso bides.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hessafe guye issoy issoy baso bides gizayssa issi issi Geeshsha Maxaafatan xaafettibeenna.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Layman Oykettida Maccassayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Hessafe guye Yesusi Dabrazayte bides. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Wonteththa gallas maalado wonttara Xoossa Keeththe simmi yides. Dereykka wuri izakko yiin izi uttidi istta tamaarso oykkides. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Muse wogaa tamaarsizaytinne Farsaaweti issi laymatashe oykettida maccas dizaaro ekki yiidi dere sinththan essida. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Yesusakka, «Astamaaree! Hekko hanna maccassaya laymatashe oykettadus. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Hanni mala maccassi shuchchan cadetta hayqqana mala Musey nu wogaan nuna azazides; nenich hanni gishshas ay gay?» gida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lewe 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Zaare 22:22-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Istti iza hessa giday iza bolla mootos gidiza gaaso demmanaassinne iza paaccana koyida gishshassa. Gido attiin Yesusi hokkidi biitta bolla ba biradhdhera xaafo oykkides.<verse eid="JHN 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Istti iza zaari zaari oychchiin dhoqqu giidi, «Intte giddofe nagaray baynda asi koyro shuch izi bolla olo» gides. <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Hessafe qasseka hokkidi biitta bolla xaafides. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9-10" />Isttika hessa siyidi cimatappe doommidi wurikka issoy issoy bida; hessa gishshas Yesusi heen eqqida maccassayra xalla attides. «Nena mootizayti awan dizoo? Ne bolla pirdiday oonikka deennee?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 8:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Izakka, «Godoo oonikka baa» gadus. Yesusikka, «Tanikka ne bolla pirdike; ba! Nam7anththo nagara ooththofa» gides.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daro maxaafatinne beni wode Geeshsha Maxaafata birsheththati shempo 7:53, shempo 8:11 gakkanaas diza qofata gujjettenna; issoti issoti Yohannisa Mishiraachcho maxaafan shempo 21:34ppe guyera gelseettes; harati qasse Luqaasa Mishiraachcho shempo 21:38ppe guyera gelseettes; issi issi Geeshsha Maxaafati qasseka Yohannisa 7:36ppe guyera gelseettes.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Alames Poo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Qasse Yesusi, «Tani alames poo7o. Tana kaallizaadey wuri de7o poo7o demmana. Dhuman simerettenna» giidi isttas yootides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mato 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">Yoha 9:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Farsaaweti, «Neni ne gishshas markkattaasa; Ne markkay tumu gidenna» gida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:31">Yoha 5:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesusikka isttas, «Tani ta gishshas ay markkattikokka ta awappe yidaakko qasse tani awa baanaakko ta eriza gishshas ta markkateththi tuma. Intte gidikko ta awappe yidaakkonne qasse awa baanaakko erekketa. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Intte asho qofa mala pirdeeta; tani gidikko oona bollaka pirdike. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ta pirdikokka ta pirday tumu pirda. Gaasoykka tani tarkka pirdike; tana kiittida ta Aawaykka tanara dees. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Nam7u asata markkay tumu gididayssi intte wogaan xaafettides. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Hessa gishshas tani ta gishshas markkattays; tana kiittida ta Aawaykka taas markkattees» gi zaarides. <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Isttika, «Ne Aaway awan dizee?» giidi iza oychchida. Yesusikka isttas, «Tana gidiin ta aawaakka gidiin intte erekketa; intte tana erizaakko ta Aawaakka eranakkoshin» giidi isttas zaarides.<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesusi hessa isttas yootiday Xoossa Keeththa gibben miishshe woththiza saaxine achchan tamaarsishe yootides; gido attiin izas oykettiza wodey gakkontta gishshas oonikka iza oykkibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesusi qasseka, «Ta baanashin intte tana koyananne intte intte nagaran hayqqana attiin ta bizaso baana dandayekketa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Ayhudatikka ba giddon issoy issaara izi, « ‹Ta bizaso intte baana dandayekketa› gizay barkka bana wodhanaasseeshaa?» geetettida.<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Izi qasse istta, «Intte garsa asa; tani bolla asa; intte hayssa alame asa; tani ha alameppe gidikke. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Intte ta oonakko eridi ammanontta aggiko intte intte nagaran hayqqana gishshas ta intte intte nagaran hayqqana giday hessa gishshassa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Isttika iza, «Ne oonee?» gida. Yesusikka isttas, «Ha7i gakkanaas ta inttes iza gishshas yootizaadey tana. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ta intte bolla haasayanayssinne pirdiza yo7oy daroy dees. Gido attiin tana kiittidaadey ammanettidaade; tanikka izappe siyidayssa ha alamezas yootays» gides.<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Izi isttas Aawaa gishshas yootizayssa akeekibeettenna. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Hessa gishshas Yesusi, «Intte Asa Naa dhoqqu histtidi kaqqida wode tani iza gididayssa intte erana; aaway tana tamaarsidayssa yootadis attiin tani ta shene mala aykkoka ooththonttayssa intte akeekana. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Tana kiittidayssi izi tanara dees. Ay wodekka ta ufayssizaaz ooththiza gishshas izi tana xalala yeggi aggibeenna» gides. <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Izi hessa yootida mala daro asay izan ammanides.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poo7o Nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesusi bana ammanida Ayhudata, «Intte tumu ta qaalan diikko intte tumappe tana kaallizayta gidana. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Tumay aazakko intte erananne tumaykka inttena wozzana» gides.<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Isttika izas zaaridi, «Nuni Abrahaame naytakko! Nu oonaska aylleti erokko; histtiin ne nuna waanada intte wozzettana gay?» gida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mato 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Luqa 3:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesusikka isttas, «Ta inttes tumu gays; nagara ooththizaadey wuri nagaras aylle; <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Ay wodekka aylley soon luxi de7enna. Yeloy gidikko aydekka soon dees. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Histtiko naazi inttena wozziko intte wozzettidayta gidana. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Intte Abrahaame nayta gididayssa ta erays; gido attiin ta qaala intte ero gi ekkontta gishshas tana wodhanaas koyeeta. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Tani ta Aawaa achchan be7idayssa inttes yootays; intte qasse intte aawappe siyidayssa ooththeeta» gides.<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Isttika izas, «Nu aaway Abrahaame» giidi zaari yootiin Yesusi isttas, «Intte Abrahaame naa gididaakko Abrahaameththo ooththana. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Intte gidikko tani Xoossafe siyida tumaa inttes yootiin tana wodhanaas gixxi dendideta. Gido attiin Abrahaamey hessaththo ooththibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Intte intte aawaththo ooththeeta» gides. Isttika zaaridi, «Nu layman yelettida naa gidokko; nu aaway issi Xoossaa xalla» giidi izas zaarida.<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xala7e Nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesusi isttas, «Intte Aaway Xoossa gididaakko tanikka Xoossafe keza yida gishshas intte tana dosanakkoshin; tana izi kiittides attiin ta tarkka ta shenen yabeekke. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Ta yootizayssa ays yuushshi qoppeketii? Gaasoykka intte ta qaala siyana koyontta gishshassa. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Intte intte aawaa Xala7e nayta; intte aawaa amo polana koyeeta; izi kasekka shemppo wodhidaade. Iza achchan tumay dontta gishshas izi tuman eqqibeenna; izi ba hu7es wordanchchanne wordo aawaa gidida gishshas izi wordo haasaya baappe medhdhi ekkidi haasayees. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ta qasse tumu haasayza gishshas intte tana ammanekketa. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Intte giddofe tana, ‹Ne hanno nagara ooththadasa› giidi markkara laththanaas mootana dandayzaadey dizee? Ta tumu haasayzaade gidikko histtiin aazas tana ammanekketii? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Xoossafe gidida asi Xoossi gizaa siyees; intte gidikko Xoossafe gidontta gishshas Xoossa qaala siyekketa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Ba Gishshas Haasaydes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Ayhudatikka zaaridi, «Nu nena ne, ‹Samaariya asa; ne bolla daydanththi dees› gidayssi tumu deennee?» gida.<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesusi isttas, «Tani ta Aawaa bonchchays attiin daydanththi ta bolla baa. Intte gidikko tana kawushsheeta. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Tani taas bonchcho koykke. Ta bonchchettana mala koyzaadey qasse dees. Izikka pirda pirdanaade. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Ta inttes tumu gays; oonikka ta qaala naagikko hayqo mulekka hayqqenna» gi zaarides.<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Ayhudati iza, «Ne bolla daydanththi dizayssa ha7i nuni eridos. Abrahaamey hayqqides; nabetikka izaththo hayqqida. Ne qasse, ‹Oonikka mule hayqo beyenna› ga yootaasa. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ne nu aawaa Abrahaameppe aadhdhay? Izi hayqqides; nabetikka hayqqida; histtiin ne nena oona gaana koyadii?» gida. <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesusikka isttas, «Ta tarkka tana bonchchiko ta bonchchoy hada. Tana bonchchizaadey gidikko intte, ‹Izi nu Xoossa› gizayssi ta Aawaa. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Intte iza erontta aggikokka ta iza erays. Ta iza erikke giikko tanikka intte mala wordanchcha gidays; ta qasse iza erays; iza qaalaakka naagays. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Intte aawaa Abrahaamey ta gallas beyanaas amottidi be7idessinne ufayettides» gides.<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Ayhudati qasse, «Nees buro ichchashu tammu layth kumontta neni Abrahaame beyadii?» gida. <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesusikka, «Ta inttes tumu gays; Abrahaamey yelettanaappe kasekka tani days» gides.<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ayhudati heerakka iza caddanaas wuri shuch denththida; gido attiin Yesusi istta matappe qotettidi Xoossa Keeththafe kezi bides.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Paththida Qooqe Addeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesusi ogera aadhdhi bishe ba aayey uloppe yelettoosofe ayfe qooqidaade be7ides. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Iza kaallizayti iza, «Astamaaree! Hayssi addezi qooqe gidi yelettana mala nagara ooththiday oonee? Iza yelidayti ooththidooyee? Izi ooththidee?» giidi Yesusa oychchida. <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesusikka isttas, «Iza gidiinkka iza yelidaytikka nagara ooththibeettenna. Izi hessaththo haniday Xoossa oosoy iza bolla qonccanaassa. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Gallassara tana kiittidaade ooso ooththanaas taas bessees. Buro oonikka ooththanaas dandayontta qammay yaana. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ha biittaa bolla diza wode ha biittaas poo7oy tana» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mato 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yoha 8:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Hessa gi simmidi biitta bolla cuch cuttidi ba cuchchan urqqa shugisidi addeza ayfeza he urqqaa tiydi, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />«Baada Selihoomen asay xammaqettizason meecetta» gides. Selihoome guussi kiitettidayssa guussa. Addezikka biidi meecettidi xeellishe simmi yides. <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Iza dooththatinne kase izi heen woossishin be7ida asay, «Hayssaadey kase uttidi woossiza addeza deennee?» gida.<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Isttafe issi issi asati, «Ee izakko» gida. Baggayti, «Iza deenna» gida. Izi qasse, «Ta izakko» gides. <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Isttika, «Histtiin ne ayfey waani xeellidee?» gi oychchida. <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Izikka zaaridi, «Yesusa geetettiza asi biitta munuqidi ta ayfeza he urqqaa tiydi tana, ‹Baada Selihoomen meecetta› gi yootiin ta baada meecettada xeellanaas dandayadis» gides. <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Isttika, «Histtiin hessaadey ha7i awan dizee?» gida; izikka, «Ta erikke» gides.<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Farsaaweti Addezi Waani Paxidaakko Qoro Oykkida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Isttika he kase ayfe qooqe addeza Farsaawetakko efida. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Yesusi urqqa munuqidi addeza ayfe paththida gallassay Ayhudata Sambata gallassa. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Hessa gishshas Farsaaweti addeza izi wostti xeellidaakko iza oychchida. Addezikka zaaridi, «Izi ta ayfen urqqa tiydes; tanikka meecettadis; hekko ha7i xeelladis» gides. <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Farsaawetappe issi issi asati, «Hayssi addezi Sambata bonchchonttaade gidida gishshas izi Xoossafe gidenna» gida. Baggayti qasse, «Nagaranchchay hayssa mala malaata waani ooththana dandayzee?» gida. Hessa gishshas istta giddon palamay medhettides. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Histtiin kase ayfe qooqe addezakko simmidi, «Ha ne ayfe paththida addeza gishshas ne ay gay?» gida. Addezi zaaridi, «Izi nabekko!» gides. <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Ayhudati addeza yelida aayeyranne aawara xeygisi ehisana gakkanaas addezi kase qooqe gididayssa ammanibeettenna.<verse eid="JHN 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Isttika yelidayta, «Intte, ‹Nuus qooqe nay yelettides› giza naazi hayssee? Histtiin ha7i waanidi xeellana dandaydee?» gida. <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Yelidaytikka hizgi zaarida, «Izi nu naa gididayssanne qooqe gidi yelettidayssa eroos. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ha7i qasse izi waani xeellana dandaydaakkonne iza ayfe ooni pogidaakko nu erokko. Izi bana dandaydaade gidida gishshas izi ba gishshas yootanaas dandayees iza oychchite» gida. <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Iza yelidayti hessaththo giday oonikka Yesusa izi Kirstoosa giidi markkattiday wuri Ayhudata woosa keeththafe goodettana mala Ayhudati kase seera ooththida gishshas Ayhudatas babbidi gida. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Hessa gishshas, «Iza yelidayti izi bana dandaydaade gidida gishshas iza oychchite» gida.<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Kase qooqe addeza qasseka xeygidi, «Haysso ne tumayo yootada Xoossa bonchcha. Hayssi addezi nagaranchcha gididayssa nu eroos» gida. <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Izikka, «Izi nagaranchcha gidiin ta erikke. Gido attiin ta kase qooqe gididaaronne qasse ha7i ta xeellizaaro hanno xalla erays» gides. <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Istti qasse iza, «Izi nees ay ooththidee? Ne ayfeza wostti pogidee?» giidi oychchida <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Izikka, «Ta inttes kase yootiin wozinan woththi siyibeekketa shin ha7i qasse aazas zaareththi siyana koyeetii? Intteka iza kaallizayta gidana koyeetii?» gides. <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Hessafe guye izas, «Nu Muse kaallizaadentta; ne iza kaallizaade gida. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Kase Xoossi Musera haasayettidayssa nu eroos; hayssi addezi awappe yidaakko nu erokko» gida. <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Addezikka isttas, «Izi awappekkon intte eronttayssi malalisees; gido attiin ta ayfe xeelisidaadey iza. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Xoossi baas yayyizaadessinne iza shene ooththizaades attiin nagaranchcha as siyonttayssa nu eroos. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Ayfe qooqidi yelettidaade ayfey xeellides gizayssa alamey medhettoosoppe oonikka siyi erenna. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Hayssaadey Xoossafe gidonttaakko hayssa ooththanaas dandayenna» gi zaarides. <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Isttika iza, «Neni nees mule asateththay nagaran munuqettiin yelettidayssi nuna tamaarsana waana xaladii?» giidi iza gooddida.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayana Yo7oy Dhumidaade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Addeza gooddidayssa Yesusi siyides. Iza demmidi, «Ne Asa Naan ammanay?» gides. <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Addezikka, «Godoo! Ta izan ammanana mala izi oonee?» gi oychchides. <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesusikka, «Ne iza beyadasa; ha7i nenara haasayzay izakko!» gides. <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Addezikka, «Godoo! Iza ammanadis» giidi izas hokki goynnides. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesusikka, «Qooqeti xeellana malanne xeellizayti qooqana mala pirdanaas ta hayssa ha alame yadis» gides. <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Izara diza Farsaawetappe issi issi asati hessa siyidi, «Hessi ay guussee? Histtiin nunikka qooqee?» gida. <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesusikka istta, «Intte qooqeta gididaakko inttes nagara gidennashin intte ha7i, ‹Nu xeelloos› giza gishshas intte nagaranchcha gidida mala daana» gides.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Lo7o Heenththanchcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesusi, «Ta inttes tumu gays; dorsata yiren pengerappe attiin hara baggara guppi gelizay kaysonne bonqqizaade. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Pengera gelizaadey izi dorsata heemmizaade. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Penge naagizaadey izas pengeza doyees. Dorsatikka iza qaala siyeettes; ba dorsata sunththara sunththara xeygi kessees. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Bayta ubbaa kessidaappe guye istta sinth aadhdhidi kaaleththees; dorsatikka iza qaala eriza gishshas iza kaalleettes. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Imaththa asa qaala erontta gishshas izappe baqateettes attiin mulekka iza kaallettenna» gides. <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesusi hessa leemisoza isttas yootides shin istti qasse izi isttas yootidayssa aykkoka eribeettenna. <verse eid="JHN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Hessa gishshas Yesusi qasseka isttas, «Ta inttes tumu gays; dorsata pengey tana.<figure style="fig" alt="Sheep in sheepfold with shepherd" file="LB00014B.TIF" size="span" ref="10:7">Dorsata dirssaninne istta heemmizayssa</figure> <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Taappe kase yidayti wuri kaysonne bonqqizayta. Dorsati gidikko istti gizaa siyibeettenna. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Pengey tana; ta baggara gelizaadey wuri attana; gelananne kezana; heemettizasokka demmana. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Kaysoy kaysotana, wodhanaassinne dhayssanaas xalla yees. Tani gidikko inttes de7oy daana malanne inttes keehi darana mala yadis.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />«Tani lo7o heenththanchcha; lo7o heenththanchchay ba shemppo ba dorsata gishshas aaththi immees. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Miishshera qaxxarettidi heemmizaadey gidikko dorsati izas gidontta gishshas kana suytey yiza wode dorsata yeggidi baas baqatees. Kana suyteykka dorsata dafi dafi meessinne laallees. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Baqatizaadey miishshan qaxxarettidaade gidida gishshassinne dorsatas mishettontta gishshassa.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />«Lo7o heenththanchchay tana; tani ta dorsata erays; isttika tana ereettes. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Hessika Aaway tana erizayssa mala tani ta shemppo dorsata gishshas aaththa immana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mato 11:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Hayssa ha dorsa yiren gelonttayti taas hara dorsati deettes; ta isttaka haa ehanaas taas bessees; isttika ta qaala siyananne issi mehe gidana. Heemmizayssika issaade gidana. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Ta zaarada denththanaas ta shemppo aaththa immiza gishshas ta Aaway tana dosees. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Tani ta shemppo ta dosara aaththa immadis attiin oonikka taappe woththi ekkenna; ta aaththa immanaas gidiin woykko zaara denththanaas gidiin sheney taassa; hessa he azazoza tani ta Aawappe ekkadis» gides.<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Hessa he qaalaappe dendidayssan Ayhudata giddon qasseka shaaketeththi medhettides. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Daro asay, «Iza bolla daydanththi diza gishshassinne izi goosh gidida gishshas intte izi gizayssa ays siyeetii?» gida.<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Baggayti qasse, «Daydanththi dizaadey hayssa mala deenna; daydanththi qooqida ayfe paththi erizee?» gida.<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayhudati Ammanontta Ixxida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Yerusalaamen Xoossa Keeththa ooraththo ba7aale bonchcho wodey gakkides; he wodeykka balgo. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesusi Xoossa Keeththa gibbe giddon Solomoone simereteththasora aadhdhishin, <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Ayhudati iza giddo aaththidi, «Ne ayde gakkanaas nu wozina hirgan gam7isanee? Ne Xoossi kiittidaade gidikko nuus qonccisa yoota» gida.<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesusikka isttas, «Ta inttes yootadiskoshin intte gidikko ammanibeekketa. Ta Aawaa sunththan ta ooththiza malatati ta gishshas yooteettes. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Intte qasse ta dorsata gidontta gishshas tana ammanekketa. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ta dorsati ta qaala siyeettes. Tanikka istta erays; isttika tana kaalleettes. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Ta isttas mernaa de7o immana; mulekka istti dhayettenna; istta ta kusheppe woththi ekkanaas dandayanaadey oonikka deenna. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Taas istta immida ta Aaway ubbaafe aadhdhees; ta Aawa kusheppe istta oonikka bonqqanaas dandayenna. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Taninne ta aaway nu issino» gides.<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Ayhudati iza caddanaas qasseka shuch denththida. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesusikka, «Aawappe gidida daro gita malaatata ta inttena bessadis. Histtiin ha ta bessidaytappe awaari gishshas tana shuchchara caddeetii?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Ayhudatikka, «Nu nena shuchchara caddizay ne as gida uttada nena nerkka Xoos kessada cashsha qaala ne haasayda gishshassafe attiin ne lo7o ooththidayssa gishshas deenna» giidi izas zaarida. <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesusikka isttas, «Intte wogaa giddon, ‹Ta inttena Xoossata gadis› geetetti xaafettibeennee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Maza 82:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Xoossa qaalay isttas yida asata, ‹Xoossi giikko Maxaafay shaarettanaas dandayonttaa gidikko› <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />histtiin, ‹Ta Xoossa naa› gida gishshas Aaway ba shaakki dummasidayssanne haa duge alame kiittidayssa intte, ‹Ne cayadasa› giidi tana wordora aazas mooteetii? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Ta Aaway ooththizayssa ta ooththontta aggiko tanan ammanopite. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ta izaththo ooththizaa gidikko intte tana ammanontta aggikokka ta Aaway tanan dizayssa tanikka izan dizayssa intte erana malanne yuushshi qoppana mala izi ooththida malaataan ammanite» gides.<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Qasseka istti iza oykkanaas koyida shin izi istta kusheppe kessi ekki bides. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Hessafe guye Yesusi, Yohannisi kase xammaqizaso Yordaanooseppe he pinth simmidi heen gam7ides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:28">Yoha 1:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Daro asay izakko yides; istti qasse, «Yohannisi issi malaatakka ooththibeenna; gido attiin hayssa addeza gishshas izi yootidayssi wurikka tumukko» gida. <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Heenkka daro asay Yesusan ammanides.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Alazaare Hayqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Bitaaniya geetettizason Maaramanne Martay diza gutan Alazaare geetettizaadey sakettides. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Izi isha Alazaarey sakettida Maarama kase Yesusa toho bolla shitto gussada Yesusa toho ba hu7e binanan quccidaarokko. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Michchetikka, «Godoo! Ne dosizayssi sakettides» giidi as Yesusaakko kiittida.<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesusi hessa siyidi, «Ha sakoy Xoossa nay izan bonchchettana malanne Xoossi bonchchettanaassafe attiin iza hayqos gaththizaaz deenna» gides. <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesusi Marta izi michcheyo Maaramonne Alazaare siiqees. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Gido attiin Alazaarey sakettidayssa siyidi heen ba dizason nam7u gallas gam7ides. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Hessafe guye bana kaallizayta, «Ane Yuhuda biitta simmi boos» gides. <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Isttika, «Astamaaree! Guuththa wodeppe kase asay nena shuchchara caddana koyeetteskoshin; ne qasse ha7i hee simma baanee?» gida.<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesusi isttas, «Issi gallassan tammanne nam7u saatey dees deennee? Gallassara hemettiza asi ha alameza poo7on simerettiza gishshas dhuphettenna. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Dhuphettizaadey gidikko izi qamara hemettizaade. Gaasoykka poo7oy baynda gishshassa» gides. <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Hessa isttas yootidaappe guye, «Nu lagge Alazaarey dhiskides; tanikka iza dhiskofe denththana bays» gides. <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Iza kaallizayti iza, «Godoo! izi dhiskidaa gidikko dendana» gida. <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yesusi isttas hessa yootiday Alazaare hayqo gishshassa; gido attiin iza kaallizaytas qasse dhisko gishshas yootidaa misatides. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Hessa gishshas qonccera isttas, «Alazaarey hayqqides. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Intte ammanana mala ta heen dontta aggidayssi intte gishshas tana ufayssees; ha7i gidikko ane gede izakko boos» gides.<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Qasse Didimoosa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Didimoosa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Didimoosa guussi mentte guussa.</char></note> geetettiza Toomaasi hankko Yesusa kaallizayta, «Ane nunikka biidi izara issife hayqqoos» gides.<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Alazaare Michcheta Minththeththides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesusi bi gakkishin Alazaarey hayqqi moogettiin oyddu gallas gidides. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Bitaaniyay Yerusalaameppe bagga saate oge haakkees. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Istta ishay hayqqida gishshas Maaramonne Marta minththeththanaas daro Ayhuda asay isttako shiiqides.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Yesusa yuussaa Martay siyada iza mokka ekkana badus; Maarama gidikko soon uttadus. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Martay Yesusa, «Godoo! Ne haan dizaakko ta ishay hayqqennakoshin. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ha7ikka gidikko ne woossida ubbaa Xoossi nees immanayssa ta erays» gadus.<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesusikka izis, «Ne ishay dendana» gides. <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Martay qasse, «Wurseththan denththa wode izi dendanayssa tanikka erays» gadus. <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesusikka izis, «Dendoynne de7oy tana; tana ammanizaadey hayqqikokka paxa daana. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Tanan dizaadeynne tana ammanizaadey mulekka hayqqenna; hessa ne ammanay?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Izakka zaarada, «Ee Godoo! Neni duge ha alameza kiitettida Xoossa Naa gididayssa ta ammanays» gadus. <verse eid="JHN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Hessa gaadanne simma ba michcheyo Maaramo dumma xeyga kessada, «Astamaarey nena koyees» gadus. <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Maaramakka hessa siyida mala elela dendada izakko badus. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Hessa gakkanaas Yesusi Martara gaaggidasohon dees attiin gede guta giddo gelibeenna <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Maaramo minththeththishe izira soon diza Ayhudatikka Maarama pusukku ga denda eqqada kezidayssa be7idi iza Alazaare duufo achchan yeekkana bizaa misatiin izo kaallida.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Maarama Yesusi dizaso gakka iza demmida mala iza toho bolla gufannada, «Godoo! Ne haan dizaakko ta ishay hayqqennakoshin» gadus.<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Izanne izo kaalli yida Ayhudati yeekkizayssa Yesusi beyi daro mishettidi, <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />«Iza awan moogidetii?» gi oychchides; isttika, «Godoo! Haa yaada beya» gida. <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesusikka afunxxides. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Ayhudatikka, «Izi iza ay mala siiqizaakko be7ite» gida. <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Istta giddofe issi issi asati, «Hayssi qooqe addeza ayfe pogdayssi hayssaadey hayqqontta mala ooththanaas dandayennee?» gida.<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Alazaare Hayqoppe Denththides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesusi iza wozinay mishettiin gede duufozakko bides; duufozikka shuchchara gordettida gongolo. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Izikka istta, «Shuchchaa denththite!» gides; hayqqidayssa michcheya Martay, «Godoo! Izi hayqqiin hach oyddu gallas gidida gishshas xinqqanakko!» gadus. <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesusikka, «Ne ammanizaa gidikko Xoossa bonchcho beyandasa gaada nees ta yootabeekkinaa?» gides. <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Hessa gishshas shuchchaa denththida; Yesusikka pude salo xeellidi, «Ta Aawawu! Ne ta gizaaz siyida gishshas ta nena galatays. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ne ubba gallas ta gizaaz siyizayssa ta erays; gido attiin ta hessa giday hayssan eqqida asati ne tana kiittidayssa ammanana malassa» gides. <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Yesusi hessa gidaappe guye kaaleththidi qaala dhoqqu histtidi, «Alazaaree! Haa keza!» giidi xeygides. <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Hayqqida Alazaareykka kumeththa asateththay moogo may7on xaaxettida mala duufozappe kezides. Yesusikka, «Birshi yeddite bo!» gides.<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asay Yesusa Wodhanaas Geeman Zoreteth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mato 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luqa 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Hessa gishshas Maaramo minththeththana yida Ayhudatappe daro asay Yesusi ooththidayssa be7idi izan ammanides. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Isttafe baggayti biidi Yesusi ooththidayssa Farsaawetas yootida. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Hessa qeeseta halaqatinne Farsaaweti Ayhudata duulata shiiqana mala xeygidi, «Ha addezi daro dumma dumma malaatata ooththidaade gidida gishshas nu ay ooththiko lo7oo? <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Nu co7u giikko asi wuri izan ammanananne Oroome asikka yiidi hayssa nu biittanne nu asaa nuuppe ekkana» gida.<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Istta giddofe issaadey he layth qeesetas waanna halaqa Qayafay, «Intte aykkoka erekketa. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Derey wuri dhayanaappe dere gishshas issi asi hayqqiko lo7o gidana gishshas yuushshi qoppeketii?» gides. <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Izi hessa baappe gidontta he layth izi qeesetas halaqa gidida gishshas Yesusi Ayhuda dere gishshas sinththafe hayqqanayssa yootides. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Izi hayqqanay he dere asaas xalla gidontta kase laalettida Xoossa naytakka issi bolla shiishshanaassa.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />He gallassafe haa simmiin iza wodhanaas maqettida. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Hessa gishshas Yesusi he gallassafe haa simmiin Ayhudata giddon qonccera simerettibeenna. Gido attiin duge bazzo biitta matan diza Efreeme geetettiza katamay dizaso biidi bana kaallizaytara heen takkides.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ayhudati Paaziga ba7aaley matida mala ba7aaley gakkanaappe kase geesho woga ooththanaas daro asay dumma dumma dereppe Yerusalaame yides. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Asay Yesusa koyishe Xoossa Keeththan eqqidi ba giddon issoy issaara, «Inttes ay misatizee? Ba7aalezas yeenneshaa?» gides. <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Qeeseta halaqatinne Farsaaweti qasse Yesusa oykkanaas izi awan dizaakko erizaadey isttas malatana mala kase azazi woththida.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yesusa Shitto Tiyida Maccassayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mato 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Paaziga ba7aales buro usuppun gallassi attishin Yesusi hayqoppe denththida Alazaarey dizaso Bitaaniya bides. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Heen Yesusas kawo kaththidi Martay iza kawo mizishin izara issife maaddan uttidaytappe issoy Alazaare. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Maarama daro al7o waagara shamettida bagga litiro gidiza geeshsha nardoose shitto ekka yaada Yesusa toho bolla gussada tohoza ba hu7e binanara quccadus. Keeththaaka shitto sawoy kumides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luqa 7:37-38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Yesusa kaallizaytappe issoy Yesusa aaththi immana Asqoronto Yuhuday, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />«Hayssi shittozi heedzdzu xeetu dinaares bayzettidi miishshay aazas manqotas imettibeennee?» gides. <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Izi hessa giday miish shiishshiza karaxiite oykkizaadey iza gidida gishshas shiiqiza miishshaafe baas shiishshidi go7ettizaade gidida gishshassa attiin manqotas mishettidi gidenna.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yesusi qasse, «Hayssi shittozi taas moogo gallassas qofettidaaz gidida gishshas he wode gakkanaas iza ba achchan naagu, bochchofte. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Manqoti ay wodekka inttenara deettes. Gido attiin intte tana ubba wode demmeketa» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Zaare 15:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />He wode daro Ayhuda asati Yesusi heen dizayssa eridi izakko yida; yidaytikka Yesusa xalala kosh gidontta Yesusi hayqoppe denththida Alazaarekka beyanaassa. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Hessa gishshas qeeseta halaqati Yesusara Alazaarekka gaththi wodhanaas ba giddon zorettida. <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Hessika Alazaare gaason daro Ayhuda asay Yesusaakko bi biidi iza ammaniza gishshassa.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Bonchchon Yerusalaame Gelides</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mato 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luqa 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Wonteththa gallas ba7aaleza bonchchana yida derey Yesusi Yerusalaame yizayssa siyides. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Zamba hayth ekkidi Yesusa mokkana kezides; derey qaala dhoqqu histtidi, «Hoosa7inna! Godaa sunththan yiza Isra7eele kawoy anjjettidayssa!» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Maza 118:25-26</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14-15" />Beni, «Hanne!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:14-15">Xiyoone nayee, babbofa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:14-15">Hekko ne kawoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:14-15">hare gutte toggidi yees»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:14-15">geetetti xaafettida mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:14-15">Yesusi hare gutte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:14-15">demmidi toggides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zaka 9:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Iza kaallizayti hessa ubbaa koyro wozinan woththibeettenna. Iza gishshas xaafettidayssanne izas oosettida hanokka ubbaa Yesusi hayqoppe dendidaappe guye erida.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Alazaare duufoppe xeygidi hayqoppe denththida wode izara issife diza asay iza denththaa gishshas markkattida. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Daro asikka izi hessa mala gita malaata ooththidayssa siyidi iza mokkana kezides. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Hessa gishshas Farsaaweti ba giddon issoy issaa, «Histtiin nuni ay ooththana dandayzonii? Be7ite! Kumeththa derey attontta iza kaallees» gida.<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Ba Hayqqanayssa Kaseti Yootides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Goynnanaas ba7aalezas shiiqida asaa giddon Girike dere asatikka deettes. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Isttika Galila giddon diza Betesayda geetettiza dere as Piliphoosa geetettizaadeko biidi, «Godoo! Nu Yesusa beyana koyoos» gida.<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Piliphoosikka Indiraasas yootides. Indiraasinne Piliphoosi biidi Yesusas yootida. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesusikka isttas, «Hekko Asa Nay bonchchettiza saatey gakkides. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Ta inttes tumu gays; gistte ayfey biittan wodhdhada hayqqontta co7u ga uttiko barkka attawus. Iza hayqqizaa gidikko hara daro ayfawus. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Ba shempo dosizaadey dhayssees. Hayssa biittaa bolla ba shemppo ixxizaadey gidikko mernaa de7o demmees. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Taas ooththana koyzaadey tana kaallo; Taas ooththizaadey ta dizason daana; taas ooththizaade ta Aaway iza bonchchana» gides.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buroppe Bana Gakkanayssa Gishshas Yesus Yootida Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Qasseka Yesusi, «Hekko ta shemppoya metotadus; ‹Ta Aawawu! Ha saateyppe tana ashsha gooshaa?› Ta hizgontta mala ta yiday hanno ha meto saateyssa.<verse eid="JHN 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />«Ta Aawawu! Ne sunththaa bonchcha» gides. Hessafe kaallidi, «Tani ta sunththaa bonchchadis; qasseka gujja bonchchana» giza qaalay saloppe yides.<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Heen eqqida asay hessa siyidi, «Daday dadatees» gida. Baggayti qasse, «Kiitanchchako haasayzay» gida.<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yesusi, «Hayssi giirissay yiday intte gishshassa attiin ta gishshas gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Hayssi alamey pirdettana wodey hayssa; hayssa dereza haariza Xala7ey ha7i gede kare yegettana. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Tani dhoqqu gaada kaqettiza wode asaa wursa taakko zaarana» gides. <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Yesusi hessa yootiday izi ay mala hayqo hayqqanaakko erisanaassa.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Asay qasse, «Nu wogan xaafettiday, ‹Xoossi kiittidaadey mernaas daana› gees; histtiin ne qasse waanada, ‹Asa Nay dhoqqu gi kaqettana bessees› gay? Ne giza Asa Nay awayssee?» gi oychchida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maza 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Hizi 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Daane 7:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesusi isttas, «Ha7i guuththa wodes inttenara poo7oy dees; gadey dhumontta poo7ora hemettite; qammara hemettizaadey izi awa bizaakko erenna. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Intte poo7o nayta gidana mala poo7oy dishin poo7on ammanite» gides. Yesusi hessa gidaappe guye biidi istta ayfeppe geemmides.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayhudati Ammano Pace</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Yesusi isttas hessa mala malaata istta sinththan ooththiinkka Ayhudati izan ammanibeettenna. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Hessi haniday nabe Isayaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Godoo! Nu markkateththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">ammaniday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Xoossa qaalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">oonas qonccidee?» gida mala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Hessa gishshas ammananaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39">dandaybeettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39">gaasoykka nabe Isayaasi kase,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />«Istti ba ayfen be7idi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ba wozinan yuushshi qoppidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">simmontta malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">izi istta paththontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">Xoossi istta ayfe qooqisides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">istta wozinakka muumisides»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">gi xaafida gishshassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa 6:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isayaasi hessa giday Xoossi kiittidaade bonchcho be7ida gishshassa; hessa gishshas Yesusi yootides.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Gidikkoka Ayhudata halaqatappe daro asay Yesusa ammanides. Gido attiin istta Ayhudata Woosa Keeththafe gooddontta mala Farsaawetas babbidi ba ammano qonccen markkattibeettenna. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Istti hessaththo haniday isttas Xoossafe imettiza bonchchofe aaththidi asappe imettiza bonchcho dosida gishshassa.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesusi ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi, «Tana ammanizaadey tanan xalala gidontta tana kiittidayssanka ammanees. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Tana be7idaadey tana kiittidayssaka beyana. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Tana ammanizay wuri dhuman dontta mala tani poo7o gidada hayssa ha alameza yadis. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Ta qaala siyidi ooththonttaade bolla pirdanay tana gidikke. Gaasoykka ta yiday alame ashshanaas attiin alame bolla pirdanaas gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Tana koyonttaadenne ta qaala ekkonttaade bolla pirdanaadey dees; ta izas yootida qaalay wurseththa gallas iza bolla pirdana. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Gaasoykka tani coo ta shenen yootabeekke; ta gizayssanne ta yootiza azazo taas immiday tana kiittida ta Aawa. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Iza azazoy mernaa de7o gididayssa ta erays; hessa gishshas ta yootizay wuri Aaway taas yootidayssa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Bana Kaallizayta Toho Meeccides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />He wodeykka Ayhudata Paaziga ba7aaleppe kase Yesusi hayssa alameza yeddidi ba Aawaakko baana saatey gakkidayssa erides; hayssa alamezan diza ba baggata ubbaa siiqides. Wurseththi gakkanaaska dosides.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesusinne iza kaallizayti issife kawo mishin Simoona nay Asqoronto Yuhuday Yesusa aaththi immana mala Xala7ey iza wozinan iita qofa gelththides. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesusi Aaway izas godateth wursi immidayssanne izi Xoossa achchafe kezidi yidayssa, qasse simmidi Xoossako baanayssa erees. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Hessa gishshas maaddaa bollafe dendidinne may7o qaari woththidi pooxa ekkidi xeessan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Xeessa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xeessa gizayssa issi issi bagga Gamoththo qaalan dabba geetettees.</char></note> gixxides. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Toho meecciza gonggen haaththe gujjidi bana kaallizayta toho meechche oykkides; ba gixxida pooxankka meeccida tohoza quccides.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Yesusi Simoona geetettiza Phexroosakko shiiqiin Simoona geetettiza Phexroosi iza, «Godoo! Ne ta toho meeccanee?» gides. <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesusikka, «Tani ooththizayssa ne ha7i erakka; guyeppe qasse ne erandasa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Phexroosikka, «Ne ta toho mulekka meeccaka» gides. Yesusi qasse, «Ta ne toho meeccontta aggiko neessinne taas issifeteththi deenna» gides. <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoona geetettiza Phexroosikka zaaridi, «Godoo, hessa gidikko taas toho xalala gidontta kushera hu7era wursa meecca» gides. <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesusi qasse, «Ba asateththi meecettidaades kumeththa bollay geesh gidida gishshas izas toho meechchafe attiin hara koshshenna. Intte geesh shin ubbata deekketa» gides. <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesusi, «Intte ubbatikka geesh deekketa» giday iza aaththi immanaadey oonakko eriza gishshassa.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Istta toho meeccidaappe guye ba may7o ekki may7idi kase ba uttidasohon simmi uttides. Qasse isttas, «Ta inttes ay ooththidaakko wozinan woththidetii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:27">Luqa 22:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Intte tana Astamaarenne Godaa geeta; ta qasse Astamaarenne Godaa gidida gishshas intte guussay tumukko. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Histtiko ta inttes Godaanne astamaare gidashe intte toho meeccizaa gidikko intteka intte giddon issoy issaa toho meeccana bessees. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ta inttes ooththidayssa mala intteka ooththana mala ta inttes leemiso bessadis. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Ta inttes tumu gays; ashkaray godaappe aadhdhenna; kiitettidaadey kiittidaadefe aadhdhenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mato 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luqa 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Yoha 15:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Intte hayssa eridi ooson peyshshiko intte anjjettidayta.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />«Ta hayssa gizay intte ubbata gishshas deenna; tani ta dooridayta wursa erays; gido attiin, ‹Ta kath midaadey ta morkke gididi ta bolla dendides› giza maxaafa qaalay polettanaas koshshees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maza 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Ta hayssa ha7ira inttes yootizay izi polettiza wode ta oonakko intte ammananaassa. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Ta inttes tumu gays; ta kiittidaade ekkizaadey tana ekkees; tana ekkizaadey tana kiittidaade ekkees» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mato 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luqa 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Bana Aaththi Immanaadey Oonakko Kaseti Yootides</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mato 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mar 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luqa 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesusi hessa gi simmidi keehi qofan gelidi, «Ta inttes tumu gays; intte giddofe issaadey tana aaththi immana» giidi qonccen yootides.<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Iza kaallizayti hessa izi oona gishshas gidaakko erontta gishshas ba giddon issoy issaara xeelettida. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Iza kaallizayta giddofe Yesusi siiqiza issoy Yesusa achchan uttides. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoona geetettiza Phexroosi Yohannisa som7i bessidi, «Izi oona gishshas gizaakko ane iza oychcha» gides.<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Hessa gishshas izi ba qoodhe gede Yesusa hayththako shiishshidi, «Godoo! Izi oonee?» gi oychchides.<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesusikka zaaridi, «Izaadey ta ha7i buddena woxen dhim7ada barsizaade» gides; hessa gi simmidi buddena woxen dhim7i ekkidi Asqorontofe yida Simoona naa Yuhuda barsides. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuhuday iza baadhida mala heerakka Xala7ey izan gelides. Yesusikka Yuhuda, «Ne ooththanaas qoppidayssa elela ooththa» gides. <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Yesusi hessa aazas gidaakko maaddaan uttida asaappe yo7oy gelidaadey oonikka deenna. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Yuhuday miish oykkizaade gidida gishshas Yesusa kaallizaytappe baggayti Yesusi Yuhuda, «Ba7aalezas koshshizayssa shamma woykko manqotas muxuwaata imma» gidaa misatides.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yuhudaykka buddennaa baadhida mala heerakka kezidi bides; izi bishin gadey qammako.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ooraththa Azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuhuday kezi bidaappe guye Yesusi, «Asa Nay ha7i bonchchettides; iza gaason Xoossika bonchchettides. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Xoossi iza gaason bonchchettizaa gidikko Xoossika iza bonchchana; heerakka gam7ontta bonchchana. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Ta naytoo! Ta inttenara daro wode gam7ike; intte tana koyana; ta kase Ayhudata halaqataska, ‹Ta bizaso intte yaana dandayekketa› gaada yootida mala ha7ikka intteska hessaththo yootays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Yoha 7:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Intte intte giddon issoy issaara siiqettana mala ta inttes ooraththa azazo immays. Ta inttena siiqida mala intte intte giddon issoy issaara siiqettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Yoha 15:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1Yoha 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2Yoha 5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Intte intte giddon siiqettiko intte tana kaallizayta gididayssa asi wuri erana» gides.<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexroosi Iza Kaddanayssa Yesusi Kasetidi Yootides</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mato 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luqa 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Hessafe guye Simoona geetettiza Phexroosi Yesusa, «Godoo! Ne awa baanee?» gi oychchides. Yesusi qasse, «Ta bizaso ne ha7i tana kaallana dandayakka shin guyeppe ne tana kaallana» gides.<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Phexroosi, «Godoo! Ta nena ha7i kaallanaas ays dandaykkinaa? Haray attoshin tani ta shemppoka ne gishshas aaththa immana» gides.<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesusikka zaaridi, «Neni ne shemppo ta gishshas aaththa immanee? Ta nees tumu gays; hach kuttoy waassanaappe kasetada ne tana heedzdzuto kaddana» gides.<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Aawaakko Gaththiza Oge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Kaaleththidikka Yesusi, «Intte wozinay metotoppo; Xoos ammanite; tanakka ammanite. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Ta Aawaa achchan daro duussasoy dees; hessa gidonttaakko, ‹Inttes daanaso giigsanaas ta baana› gaana shin. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Baada ta inttes soo giigsidaappe guye intte ta dizason daana mala ta simma yaada inttena ekkana. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Ta biza oge intte ereeta» gides.<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Toomaasi, «Godoo! Ne awa bizaakko nu erokkon; histtiin ogeza nu wostti eranaas dandayzonii?» gides. <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesusikka izas, «Ogeynne, tumay, de7oykka tana; ta baggara gidikkofe attiin oonikka Aawaakko baana asi deenna. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Intte tana erizaakko ta Aawaakka eranakkoshin; ha7i hayssafe guye intte iza erana; iza be7okka beyideta» gi zaarides. <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Piliphoosi, «Godoo! Ne nuna Aawaa bessiko nuus gidana» gides.<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesusikka izas, «Piliphoosaa! Hayssa gakkanaas ta inttenara de7inkka ne tana erkkii? Tana be7idaadey Aawaakka be7ides; histtiin neni waanada, ‹Nuna Aawaa bessa› gay? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Tani ta Aawaan, ta Aawaykka tanan dizayssa ammanikkii? Ta inttes yootiza qaala yootizay ta shene mala deenna; gido attiin oosoza ubbaa ooththizay tanan diza ta Aawaa. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Tani Aawaan diza mala, Aawaykka tanan dizayssa intte ammanite; akkay giikko ta ooththiza oosota gishshassika tana ammanite. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Ta inttes tumu gays; tana ammanizaadey ta ooththiza ooso ooththana; hessafekka aaththi ooththana; gaasoykka tani Aawaakko baana. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Aaway naaza gaason bonchchettana mala intte ta sunththan woossidayssa ta inttes wursa ooththana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Intte ay miishshika ta sunththan woossidayssa ta ubbaa ooththana.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Xillo Ayana Gishshas Immida Hidota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />«Intte tana dosizaa gidikko ta azazoyo naagite. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Tani Aawa woossana; Izikka inttenara mernaas daana mala hara inttena minththeththanaade inttes immana. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Hayssi minththeththiza Ayanay dere asay iza beyi erontta gishshas alamey ekkanaas dandayontta Tumu Ayana; gido attiin intte iza ereeta; gaasoykka izi inttenara diza gishshassinne izi intte gaaththan diza gishshassa.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />«Aawaynne aaya baynda nayta mala ta inttena xalla aggike; ta simmada ha intteko yaana. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Guuththa wodeppe guye dere asay tana beyenna; intte gidikko beyandeta; tani de7on diza gishshas intteka de7on daandeta. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Tani ta Aawaan diza mala intteka tanan dizayssanne tanikka inttenan dizayssa intte he wode erandeta.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />«Ta azazo ekkidi ooththizaadey tana dosees; tana dosizaadeka ta Aaway dosees; tanikka iza dosana; tanakka izaades qonccisana» gides.<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Asqoronto Yuhuda gidontta hankko Yuhuday, «Godoo! Neni alame asaas gidontta nuus wostta nena qonccisanee?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesusikka izas, «Tana siiqizaadey ta qaala naagana; ta Aawaykka iza dosana; nuni izakko yaana; yiidikka izaadera issife daana. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Tana dosonttaadey ta qaala naagenna; hayssi intte siyiza qaalay tana kiittida ta Aawa qaalappe attiin ta qaala gidenna.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />«Tani ha7i inttenara dashe hayssa inttes yootadis. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Aaway ta sunththan yeddana minththeththiza Xillo Ayanay qasse haniza ubbaa inttena tamaarsana; ta inttes yootoyssaka ubbaa intte wozinan woththana mala maaddana.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />«Ta inttes saroteth aggada bays; ta saroteththika ta inttes immana; ta inttes immiza saroteththi alamey immiza saroteththa mala deenna; intte wozinay hirgofonne babbofo.<verse eid="JHN 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />« ‹Ta baana; baadakka intteko simma yaana› gaada ta inttes kase yootidayssa siyideta; intte tana dosizaakko tani ta Aawaakko bizayssi inttena ufayssanakkoshin. Gaasoykka Aaway taappe aadhdhees. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Hayssi haniza wode intte ammanana mala hayssa ta inttes kaseta yootadis. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Hayssa alameza haariza Xala7ey yiza wodey gakkida gishshas ha7i ta inttenara daro haasaykke; izi ta bolla aykkoka ooththanaas izas wolqqay deenna. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Gido attiin tani Aawaa dosizayssa alamey erana mala Aaway tana azazidayssa ta ubbaa polana. Ane hayssafe boos; dendite» gides.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Tumu Woyne Miththas Ano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Qasseka Yesusi, «Tumu woyne miththa anoy tana; atakilteza oosanchchay ta Aawa. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Ta bolla dishe ayfe immontta hagga ubbaa ta Aaway qanxxi diggana; ayfiza haggaa gujji ayfana mala qirxi geeshshana. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Ta inttes yootida qaalaa gaason intte ha7i geeshshata. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Tanan diite; tanikka inttenan daana; haggay woyne ano bolla dontta aggiko barkka ayfe ayfana dandayonttayssa mala intteka tanan dontta aggiko ayfe ayfanaas dandayekketa.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />«Tani woyne miththas ano; intte qasse haggata; daro ayfe ayfizaadey tanan dizaadenne tanikka izan dizaade; gaasoykka ta baynda intte aykkoka ooththanaas dandayekketa.<figure style="fig" alt="Grape vine on trellis" file="HK00112B.TIF" size="span" ref="15:5">Ayfera diza woyne mith</figure> <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Tanan bayndaadey qanxxettidi wora yegettida haggaa mala kare yegettidi heen melana; heyta mala haggati issi bolla shiiqidi taman yegettannanne eexxana. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Intte tanan diikko ta qaalaykka inttenan diikko intte koyidayssa oychchiko demmana. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Daro ayfe intte ayfishin ta Aaway bonchchettees; intte tana kaallizayta gididayssi hessan erettana.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />«Aaway tana dosidayssaththo tanikka inttena dosadis; hessa gishshas intte ta siiqon diite. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Tani ta Aawaa azazo polada iza siiqon dida mala intteka ta azazo polikko ta siiqon daana. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Hayssa ta inttes yootizay ta ufayssi inttenan gidana malanne intte ufayssika kumeth gidanaassa. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Ta inttes immiza azazoy ta inttena siiqida mala intteka intte giddon issoy issaara siiqettanaassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yoha 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1Yoha 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2Yoha 5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Asi ba lagges ba shemppo aaththi imoppe aadhdhiza siiqoy deenna. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Ta inttena azazizayssa ubbaa intte polikko intte ta laggeta. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Ashkaray goday ooththizayssa erontta gishshas hayssafe guye ta inttena ashkarata giikke. Gido attiin tani ta Aawappe siyidayssa wursa inttes qonccisida gishshas ta inttena ta laggeta gadis. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Ta inttena dooradis attiin intte tana dooribeekketa; intte biidi daro ayfe ayfana mala intte ayfey eqqi daana mala ta inttena woththadis; hessa gishshas intte ta sunththan woossidayssa ubbaa ta Aaway inttes immana. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Hessa gishshas intte intte giddon issoy issaara siiqettana mala ta inttena azazays.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Bana Kaallizayta Alamey Ixxanayssa Yootides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />«Kaaleththidikka Yesusi inttena alamey ixxiko inttefe kase tana ixxidayssa erite. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Intte ammanontta alame asaa gidikko alame asay ba bagga gididaade dosees. Gido attiin intte alame bagga gidontta gishshas ta inttena alameppe shaakkada doorida gishshas derey inttena ixxees. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />‹Ashkaray godaappe aadhdhenna› gaada ta kase inttes yootoyssa yuushshi qopite; istti tana gooddizayti inttenakka gooddana; istti ta qaalaa naagizaakko intte qaala naagana. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Istti tana kiittidaade erontta gishshas ta gaason intte bolla hessa wursi ooththana. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Ta yaada isttas yootonttaako isttas nagara gidenna. Ha7i qasse istta nagaraas hanno giza gaasoykka baa. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Tana ixxizaadey ta Aawaakka ixxees. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Hara asi ooththontta ooso ta istta giddon ooththonttaako isttas nagara gidennashin; ha7i istti hessa ubbaa be7idaappe guye tanakka ta Aawaakka ixxida. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Hessika haniday kase, ‹Tana gaasoykka baynda dishin ixxida› geetettidi istta wogan xaafettida qaalay polettanaassa.<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />«Gido attiin Aawappe kezidi yaanayssi, tanikka ta Aawa achchafe inttes yeddanayssi minththeththiza Tuma Ayanay yiidi izi ta gishshas markkattana. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Intte koyroppeka tanara diza gishshas taas intteka markkattandeta» gides.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Qasseka Yesusi, «Hekko hayssa wursa ta inttes intte ammanoy yark yarkofo gaada yootadis. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Istti inttena ba keeththafe gooddana; haray attoshin inttena wodhizaadey wuri Xoossas ooththizaade misatiza wodey yaana. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Istti hessaththo ooththizay tanakka, ta Aawaakka erontta gishshassa. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Ta hayssa inttes yootiza wode intte ta inttes gidayssa qoppanaassa» gides. Kaaleththidikka Yesusa, «Hayssa wursa ta inttes yootontta aggiday ta inttenara issife diza gishshassa.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xillo Ayana Ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />«Ha7i qasse tana kiittidayssako ta baana gays; gido attiin inttefe oonikka, ‹Ne awa baanee?› giidi oychchanay baa. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Gido attiin hayssa wursa ta inttes yootida gishshas intte wozinay muuzottees. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Ta qasse inttes tumu gays; ta buussi inttes go7a gidana; gaasoykka ta bontta aggiko minththeththiza Ayanay intteko yeenna; ta bidaappe guye iza intteko yeddana. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Izi yiidi asa nagara gishshassinne xilloteththa gishshas qasseka pirda gishshas erisana. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Asa nagara gishshas izi erisanay asay tana ammanontta gishshassa. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Xilloteththa gishshas izi asaa erisanay tani ta Aawaakko biza gishshassinne qasse nam7anththo intte tana be7ontta gishshassa. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Pirda gishshas izi erisanay hayssa alameza haarizayssa bolla pirdettida gishshassa.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />«Ta inttes buro yootana daro yo7oy dees; gido attiin ha7i inttena deexxana. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Tuma Ayanay yiidi inttena tumay dizaso kaaleththana; gaasoykka izi siyidayssa yootana attiin baappe gidontta gishshas izi sinththafe hanana yo7ota inttes yootana. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Taas dizayssafe ekkidi izi inttes yootiza gishshas tana bonchchana. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Aawaas gididay wurikka tayssa, ‹Taas gididayssafe ekkidi izi inttes yootana› ta giday hessassa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intte Muuzoteththi Ufayssan Laamettana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Yesusi gujjidi, «Guuththa wodeppe guye intte tana beyekketa; qasseka guuththa wodeppe guye intte tana beyana» gides.<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Iza kaallizaytappe baggati ba giddon, « ‹Hayssi nuus guuththa wodeppe guye intte tana beyekketa; qasseka guuththa wodeppe guye intte tana beyana; qasse ta Aawaakko baana› guussi ay guussee?» gida. <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />«Histtiin hayssi, ‹Guuththa wodeppe guye› gizayssi izi aazee? izi yootizayssi nuus erettenna» giidi ba giddon zaari zaari oyshettida.<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Istti iza oychchanayssa Yesusi eridi isttas, «Intte intte giddon issoy issaara oyshettizay ta inttes, ‹Guuththa wodeppe guye intte tana beyekketa; qasseka guuththa wodeppe guye intte tana beyana› gida gishshassee? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Ta inttes tuma gays; intte waassananne yeekkanashin alamey gidikko ufayettana. Intte muuzottishin intte muuzoy ufayssan laamettana. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Maccassi yelo wodey gakkishin miixas hirgawus; gido attiin naa yela yeggidaappe guye biitta bolla nay yelettida gishshas ufayssafe dendidayssan kase ba waaydayssa zaara qoppuku. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Hessaththo intteka ha7i muuzotteeta; qasse ta inttena beyana intte wozinaykka ufayettana; intte ufayssaa zaari ekkanaadey deenna.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />«Intte he wode taappe aykkoka woosseketa; ta inttes tumu gays; ta sunththan ta aawaa woossiko izi inttes ubbaaka immana. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Hanno gakkanaas intte ta sunththan aykkoka woossi erekketa; woossite intte ekkana; intte ufayssayka kumeth gidana.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />«Ha7i gakkanaas ta inttes leemisora yootadis; hayssafe guye ta leemisora yootontta wodey yaana. Gido attiin Aawaa gishshas ta inttes ubbaa qonccisa yootana. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />He wode intte ta sunththan woossana; tanikka, ‹Aawaa intte gishshas woossana› giikke. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Gaasoykka Aaway ba baggara inttena dosiza gishshassa; Aaway inttena dosizay intte tana dosiza gishshassinne tani Xoossa achchafe yidayssa intte ammanida gishshassa. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Tani Aawaa achchafe kezada hayssa ha alame yadissinne qasseka ha alameza aggada Aawaakko simma baana» gides.<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Iza kaallizayti, «Hekko ne ha7i leemiso gidontta nuus qonccera yootadasa. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Ne wursa eriza malanne oonikka nena oychchanaas koshshonttayssa ha7i nu eridos; hessa gishshas ne Xoossa achchafe kezidayssa nu ammanoos» gida.<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesusi isttas, «Intte ha7i ammanideta; <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />gido attiin intte intte baggara baggara laalettidi tana xalla aggana wodey gakkides; he saateyakka ha7i gakkadus. Gido attiin Aaway tanara gidida gishshas ta tarkka diikke. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Ta hayssa inttes yootizay intte tanan de7iin inttes saroteththi daana mala gaada yootays. Intte ha alamen dishin inttes waayey dees; gido attiin aykkoy baa; ta alame xoonadis» gides.<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yesusa Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesusi hessa gidaappe guye pude salo dhoqqu gi xeellidi, «Ta Aawawu! Hekko ha7i saatey gakkides; ne nay nena bonchchana mala neni ne naaza bonchcha. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Ne bonchchanaykka ne izas immidaytas izi mernaa de7o immana mala ne izas asa ubbaa bolla godateth immida gishshassa. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Mernaa de7oykka ne xalla tumu Xoossanne ne kiittida Yesus Kirstoosa ero guussa. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Ne taas immida ooso tani wursada ha biittaa bolla nena bonchchadis. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Ta Aawawu! Alamey medhettanaappe kase taas nenara diza bonchchon ha7ikka tana ne achchan bonchcharkkii!<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />«Hayssa alame asaappe ne taas doorada immida asatas ne oonakko ta isttas nena qonccisadis; istti kasekka neyta shin ne taas immadasa; isttika ne qaalaa naagida. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Ne taas immidayssi wurikka neeppe gididayssa istti ha7i erida. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Ne taas immida qaalatakka ta isttas immadis; isttika ekkida; ta ne achchafe yidayssa istti tumappe erida; ne tana kiittidayssaka istti ammanida.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />«Ta isttas woossays; heyti ne taas immidayti istti neyta gidida gishshas ta isttas woossays; gido attiin hankko alame asaas woossike. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Taas gididay wurikka neyssa; neyssi wurikka tayssa; tanikka isttan bonchchettana. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Hayssafe guye tani hayssa alame bolla diikke; istti gidikko ha alameza bolla deettes; ha7i ta neekko bays; ta Aawa Geeshshazoo! Hayta ne taas immidayta istti nu mala ba giddon issino gidana mala ne taas immida ne sunththaan istta naaga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ne taas immida sunththaan istta naaga gizayssa issi issi Geeshsha Maxaafati ne taas immida ubbaa ne sunththan naaga geettes.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Ta isttara issife dashe ne taas immida ne sunththaan ta istta naagadis; hessa gishshas kase xaafettida Geeshsha Maxaafaa qaalay polettana mala izi kasekka dhayos diza naazappe attiin isttafe oonikka dhaybeenna. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Ta qasse ha7i neekko bays; ta ha alameza bolla dashe hayssa yootizay ta ufayssi isttan polettana mala gaada yootays. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Tani ne qaalaa isttas immadis; tani hayssa alameza as gidonttayssa mala isttika ha alame as gidettenna; hessa gishshas ha alame asay istta ixxides. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Ne istta iitappe naagana mala ta nena woossays attiin ne istta ha alameppe denththa efana mala ta nena woossike. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Tani alame as gidonttayssa mala isttika ha alame as gidettenna. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Ne istta ne tuman nees shaakka; ne qaalaykka tumu qaala. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ne tana ha alame kiittoyssaththo tanikka istta alame bolla kiittadis. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Istti tumappe nees dumma as gidida mala tanikka tana istta gishshas dummasays.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />«Istta qaala markkateththan tana ammananayta gishshassara ta nena woossays attiin ta nena istta gishshas xalla woossike. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Ta woossizay istti wurikka issino gidana malassa. Ta Aawawu! Qasseka ne tanan diza mala isttika nunan gidana malanne ne tana kiittidayssa ha alamey ammanana mala ta nena woossays. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Nuni nu giddon issino gidida mala isttika ba giddon issino gidana mala ne taas immida bonchchoza tanikka isttas immadis. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Ta nena woossizay ta isttan; nekka tanan gidida mala isttika kumeth issino gidana malassa. Qasseka neni tana kiittida malanne tana ne siiqida mala isttaka ne siiqidayssa alame asay eranaassa.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />«Ta Aawawu! Ne tana hayssi alamey medhettanaappe kase dosida gishshas ne taas immida ta bonchchoza istti beyana mala hayti ne taas immidaytikka ta dizason tanara daana mala dosays. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Xillo gidida ta Aawawu! Nena alamey eribeenna; ta gidikko nena erays; haytikka ne tana kiittidayssa erida. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Ne tana siiqida siiqoy isttan gidana malanne tanikka isttan gidana mala isttika nena erana mala ooththadis. Qasseka istti erana mala ta ooththana» gides.<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Morkketa Kushen Aadhdhi Yesusa Imeteth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mato 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luqa 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Hessa ubbaa yootidaappe guye Yesusi bana kaallizaytara Qediroone geetettiza shoobba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Shoobba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shoobba gizayssa issi issi bagga Gamoththo qaalan zulle geettes.</char></note> pinnidi atakilte giddo gelides. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yesusinne iza kaallizayti kasekka he gadeyin daro wode issife shiiqiza gishshas Yesusa aaththi immida Yuhuday he gadeyo kasekka erees. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Hessa gishshas Yuhuday wottadarata, qeeseta halaqatanne Farsaawetappe kiitetti yida ashkarata wursi kaaleththi ekkidi hee istti shiiqizaso yides. Izara yida asay paanose, xomppe, mashshanne toora oykkidi yides. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesusi ba bolla gakkanayssa ubbaa eridi yida asaakko biidi, «Oona koyeetii?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Istti qasse, «Naazirete Yesusa koyoos» gida. Izikka isttas, «Tani izakko» gides. Isttas aaththi immida Yuhuday isttara issife eqqides. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesusi, «Tani izakko» gida mala asati guye gandigardi biitta bolla kundida. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesusi ha7ikka, «Oona koyeetii?» gi oychchiin istti zaaridi, «Naazirete Yesusa koyoos» gida. <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Izikka zaaridi, «Tani izakko; histtiin intte koyzay tana gidikko hayti betto bochchofte» gides. <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Hessi haniday, «Ta Aawawu! Ne taas immidaytappe issaadeka ta dhayssabeekke» gida qaalay polettana malassa.<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoona geetettiza Phexroosi giththa mashsha oykkida gishshas mashshaa koohoppe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Koohoppe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Koohoppe gizayssa issi issi bagga Gamoththo qaalan shohoppe geettes.</char></note> shoddidi issi qeeseta halaqa ashkara dizayssa hayth mashshara qanxxi yeggides; he ashkaraza sunththi, «Malkoosa» geetettees. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesusi qasse Phexroosa, «Ne mashshaza koohon zaara gelththa. Aaway taas immida waaye ushshaa ta uyontta aggana misatizee?» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mato 26:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mar 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Luqa 22:42</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeeseta Halaqa Haanna Sinth Yesusa Shiiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Hessafe guye wottadarati, istta azazizayssinne Ayhudata ashkarati Yesusa oykkidi qachchida. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Koyro he layththan qeesetas halaqa Qayafa bollo Haannako efida. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Qayafay, «Dere gishshas issaadey hayqqiko lo7o» giidi Ayhudata daannata kase zoridaade.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49-50">Yoha 11:49-50</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexroosi Yesusa Kaddides</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mato 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mar 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luqa 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoona geetettiza Phexroosinne Yesusa kaallizaytappe issaadey Yesusa kaallida; hessaadey qeeseta halaqa achchan keehi erettidaade. Hessa gishshas Yesusara issife qeeseta halaqaza gibbe gelides. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Phexroosi gidikko pengefe kare baggara eqqides; qeeseta halaqa achchan keehi erettidi Yesusa kaallizayssi yiidi pengen diza garadeya Phexroosa gibbe giddo gelththana mala yootidi Phexroosa ekki gelides. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Penge naagiza garadeya Phexroosa, «Nekka hessa addeza kaalliza asatappe issaa diikkii?» gadus; izi qasse, «Tani iza kaallizaade gidikke» gides.<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Wodey meeggiza wode gidida gishshas oosanchchatinne ashkarati tama eeththidi eqqi ho7eettes. Phexroosikka isttara eqqidi ho7ees.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeeseta Halaqazappe Yesusas Shiiqida Oysho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mato 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luqa 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />He wode qeeseta halaqay Yesusa iza kaallizayta gishshassinne izi tamaarsida timirte gishshas oychchides. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesusikka izas, «Ta asa ubbaas qonccen yootadis; Ayhudati shiiqiza istta Woosa Keeththan gidiinkka Xoossa Keeththan tamaarsadis; ta qotan haasaydaazi aykkoyka deenna. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Histtiin ne tana oychchizay aazee? Ta yootishin siyidayta oychcha; ta yootidayssa istti ereettes» gides.<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Yesusi hessa gida mala heen eqqida ashkaratappe issoy, «Qeeseta halaqas hayssaththo wostta zaaray?» gishe Yesusa shagalan baqa shaayides.<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesusikka zaaridi, «Ta iita haasaydaa gidikko ane ta goyssa ne markkatta; Ta yootiday likke gidikko tana aazas baqqay?» gides. <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Hessafe guye Haannay Yesusa qachchida mala qeeseta halaqa Qayafakko yeddides.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexroosi Yesusa Zaaridi Kaddides</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mato 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mar 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luqa 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />He wode Simoona geetettiza Phexroosi eqqidi tama ho7ishin hankko asay iza, «Haysso! Ne Yesusa kaallizaytappe issaa diikkii?» gida. Izikka zaaridi, «Ta iza kaallizaade diikke» giidi kaddides.<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Kase Phexroosi iza hayth qanxxidayssa dabboy qeeseta halaqa ashkaratappe issoy, «Wona ta nena atakilteson isttara dishin beyabeekkinaa?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Phexroosi qasseka kaddides; heerakka kuttoy waassides.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Philaxoosa Sinth Yesusa Shiiqo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mato 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luqa 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Hessafe guye Yesusa Qayafa keeththafe dere ayssiza kawoza gibbe mallado wonttara ekki bida. Ayhuda asas Paaziga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Paaziga: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paaziga gizayssi Xoossa kiitanchchay Isra7eele asata wodhontta ashshiin Gibxe asa kiitanchchay wodhida gaason Isra7eele asay Xoossa bonchcho gishshas bonchchiza ba7aale.</char></note> ba7aale dorsa asho miza wode gidida gishshas bana tunisontta mala giidi malladora dere ayssizayssa gibbe giddo gelibeettenna. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Hessa gishshas Philaxoosi isttako kezidi, «Hayssa addeza intte aazas mooteetii?» giidi oychchides.<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Istti qasse, «Hayssi addezi iita ooththonttaade gididaakko nu iza nees aaththi immokoshin» gida.<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Philaxoosikka, «Intte iza ekki biidi intte wogaa mala pirdite» gides. Ayhudata ayssizayti qasse zaaridi, «Nuni as wodhana mala nuus piqaadey imettibeenna» gida.<verse eid="JHN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Hessika haniday Yesusi kase isttas izi waani hayqqanaakko yootida qaalay polettana gishshassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Yoha 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Philaxoosi qasseka guye gibbe giddo gelidi Yesusa xeygisidi, «Ne Ayhudata kawoo?» giidi oychchides.<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesusikka zaaridi, «Ne hessa gizay neeppeyee? Woykko hara asati ta gishshas nees yootidoo?» gides. <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Philaxoosikka, «Ta Ayhuda asee? Nena taas aaththi immidayti ne baggatanne qeeseta halaqataakko; ne ay ooththadii?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesusikka, «Ta kawoteththi hayssa ha alame bolla gidenna. Ta kawoteththi hayssa ha alame bolla gididaakko Ayhudata daannata kushen ta kundontta mala ta ashkarati ta gishshas olettanakkoshin ta kawoteththi gidikko ha alame bolla gidenna» gides. <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Philaxoosikka, «Histtiin ne kawoo?» gides; Yesusi qasse, «Tani ne gidayssa mala ee kawo; ta yelettidaynne ha biittaa yiday tumaa gishshas markkattanaassa; tumappe gididay wuri ta qaala siyees» gides.<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Philaxoosikka, «Tumay aazee?» gides; hessafe guye Philaxoosi nam7anththo Ayhudatakko kezidi, «Ta iza bolla aykko balakka beyabeekke. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Gido attiin kasekka ta inttes Paaziga ba7aale gallas issi qasho as birshiza mala hayssa Ayhudata kawo inttes birshana mala koyeetii?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Istti gidikko, «Nuus Barbaane birsha attiin hayssa deenna!» giidi waassida; Barbaaney ba hu7es panga.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yesusa Bolla Wottadarata Qidhe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-32">Mato 27:27-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:15-21">Mar 15:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Hessafe guye Philaxoosi Yesusa efidi garafissides. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Wottadaratikka agunththa zawude xaaxidi Yesusa hu7en woththida; zo7o kaabbaka mayzida. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Izakko shiiqi shiiqidi, «Ayhuda kawo saro! saro!» gi giidi iza shagalan baqqida.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Philaxoosi qasseka kare kessidi, «Hekko ta iza bolla aykko moorokka demmonttayssa intte erana mala ta iza inttes haa kare kessana» gides. <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Hessa gishshas Yesusi agunththa zawude hu7en woththi ekkidi zo7o kaabba may7idi kare kezides. Philaxoosikka isttas, «Hekko addezi hayssich!» gides.<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Qeeseta halaqatinne istta ashkarati Yesusa be7idi, «Ne iza kaqqa! Kaqqa!» gishe waassida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Philaxoosi qasse, «Tani ta baggara iza bolla issi moorokka demmabeekke; koykko intte efidi kaqqite» gides.<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Ayhuda asati qasse, «Nuus wogay dees; hayssi addezi bana Xoossa naa giza gishshas nu woga mala izas hayqoy bessees» gida. <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Philaxoosi hessa istti gizayssa siyidi daro babbides. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Gede gibbe gelidi Yesusa, «Ne awappe yadii?» gi oychchides. Yesusi qasse izas ay zaarokka immibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Hessa gishshas Philaxoosi, «Ne taas yootikkii? Ta nena kaqqanaas woykko birsha yeddanaas godateththi taas dizayssa erkkii?» gides.<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesusikka izas zaaridi, «Sheney nees Xoossafe imettonttaako nees ta bolla ay godateththika deennashin; gido attiin tana nees aaththi immidaade bolla gita nagaray dees» gides.<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusa Bolla Pirdettida Hayqo Pirda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mato 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mar 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luqa 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Philaxoosi hessa Yesusa haasaya siyidaappe guye iza birshi yeddana koyides shin Ayhudatas babbida gishshas istti, «Ne hayssa addeza birshiko Oroome Kawo Qeesaare bagga gidakka; gaasoykka bana barkka kawoththizaadey wuri Qeesaares morkke» gishe wurikka waassida.<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Philaxoosi hessa siyida mala Yesusa kare kessidi, «Lochcha shuch» geetettizason pirda womboran uttides. He pirdasoy Ayhudata qaalara, «Gabata» geetettees. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />He wode gadey asi Paaziga ba7aales giigettiza gallassa. Wodeykka gallassafe usuppun saate mala gidides; he wode Philaxoosi Ayhudata, «Hekko intte kawoy hayssich!» gides.<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Gido attiin istti qasse, «Gede digga! Gede digga! Kaqqa!» gishe waassida. Philaxoosikka, «Ta intte kawo kaqqoo?» gides. Qeeseta halaqati zaaridi, «Nuus Qeesaareppe hara kawoy deenna» gida.<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Hessafe simmidi Philaxoosi Yesusa kaqqana mala isttas aaththi immides. Isttika Yesusa oykki ekki efida.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusa Kaqeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Hessafe guye Yesusi ba kaqettana masqaleza tookkidi, «Asa hu7e guugge» geetettizaso kezides. He sohoy Ayhudata qaalara, «Golgota» geetettees. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Iza heen kaqqida. Yesusa giddo gelththidi hara nam7u asata izaththo hadirsaranne ushachchara kaqqida.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Philaxoosi, «Naazirete Yesusi Ayhudata kawo» giza qaala xaafidi iza masqale bolla izas hu7esora qaaphides. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Yesusi kaqettidasoy katamaas mata gidida gishshas daro Ayhuda asay Philaxoosi xaafidayssa nababides; xaafettidayssika Ayhudata qaalara, Laatine qaalaranne Girike qaalara. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Ayhudata qeeseta halaqati Philaxoosa, «Ne iza Ayhudata kawo» gaada xaafoppa. Gido attiin, « ‹Hayssi addezi bana ta Ayhudata kawo› gides gaada xaafa» gida.<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Philaxoosi qasse, «Ta xaafidayssa xaafadis» gides. <verse eid="JHN 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Wottadarati Yesusa kaqqidaappe guye iza may7oza ekkidi wottadarata issaa issaa gakkana mala oyddu kessi shaakereththida. Garsara may7iza may7ozakka hessaththo shaakereththida. Gido attiin garsara may7iza may7ozi sikettontta pudeppe duge gakkanaas coo yeda dees. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Hessa gishshas wottadarati ba giddon, «Gishan oona gakkanaakko erana mala iza bolla saama yeggana attiin daakkoko» gida; hessika haniday kase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Ta may7o istti gishetti ekkida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">tani bollara may7iza may7oza bolla saama yeggida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">geetettida Geeshsha maxaafa qaalay polettana malassa. Wottadaratikka hessa ooththida.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Yesusa masqale achchan iza aayeyanne aayey michcheya Qaliyopha machcha Maaramanne Magdale geetettizasoppe yida Maarama heen eqqida. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesusi ba aayeyonne izi siiqiza iza kaallizayssi ba achchan eqqidayta be7idi ba aayeyo, «Aayee! Ne naaza hessa beya» gides.<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Hessafe kaaleththidi bana kaallizayssa, «Ne aayo hinno beya» gides. Hinno he saateyppe simmiin iza kaallizayssi aayeyo baso efides.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusa Hayqo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mato 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luqa 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Hessafe guye Yesusi ha7i wurikka polettidayssa eridi Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettidayssi polettana mala, «Tana saamees» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maza 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Heen caala phanqida ushshi kumi uttida issi xaaro malay dees. Hessa gishshas heen dizayti he caala ushshaa zandza misatiza safinege geetettizayssara hisophphe geetettiza miththa xeeran qaaphidi iza doonaakko shiishshida. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesusi he caala ushshaa xunxi xeellidi, «Polettides!» gides. Ba hu7e duge ziqqisidi shemppo kezides.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Hessafe guye Ayhudata daannati kaqettida asata meqeth wodirappe menththidi istti iza masqale bollafe woththana mala Philaxoosa woossida. Istti hessa ooththiday Ayhudati sambatas giigettiza gallas gidida gishshassinne he sambataykka daro gita ba7aale gidida gishshas Sambata gallas ahay masqale bolla gam7ontta mala koyida gishshassa. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Hessa gishshas wottadarati biidi Yesusara kaqettida asata meqeth wodirappe wodirappe menththida. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Istti Yesusaakko biin izi kaseti hayqqidayssa be7idi iza wodira meqeth menththibeettenna. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Gido attiin wottadarata giddofe issaadey toorara iza millen caddiin heerakka suuththinne haaththi gukkides. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Hessa be7idaadey intte izan ammanana mala markkattides; iza markkateththika tuma. Izi yootizaykka tumu gididayssa izi erees. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Hessika haniday, «Iza meqeththafe issinakka meqquku» geetettida Geeshsha maxaafa qaalay polettanaassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Kessa 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Tay 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Maza 34:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Qasseka Geeshsha Maxaafan harason, «Istti bana caddidaade beyana» gees.<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusa Moogeteth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mato 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luqa 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ayhudata daannata babbidi qotan Yesusa kaalliza Armatiyase geetettizasoppe yida Yooseefey Yesusa aha ekkanaas Philaxoosa woossiin Philaxoosikka izas ero gides. Hessa gishshas Yooseefey biidi Yesusa aha ekkides. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Kase Yesusaakko qamara yida Niqodimoosikka bagga kilo gidiza karbbenne godare uuththara walakettida shitto ekki yides. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />He nam7u asati Yesusa ahaza ekkidi Ayhudati ahaa xaaxiza mala shitto puukkidi lee7e may7ora xaaxida. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Yesusi kaqettidasohon issi atakiltesoy dees. He atakiltezason oonikka moogettontta ooraththa duufoy dees. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Ayhudata sambatas giigettiza gallas gidida gishshassinne duufoykka matan diza gishshas Yesusa aha heen moogida.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Hayqoppe Yesusa Denth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mato 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luqa 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Wogga gallas wontta mallado buro bazzoy zo7ishin Magdale Maarama Yesusa duufokko badus. Iza he gakkishin kase Yesusa duufo izara gordida shuchchay duufoza doonappe dendidi genderidayssa beyadus. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Hessa gishshas iza Yesusa kaallizaytappe Simoona geetettiza Phexroosakko Yesusi dosiza hankko iza kaallizayssako woxxa baada, «Godaa duufoppe kessi ekkidi awan woththidaakko nu erokko» gadus.<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Heerakka Phexroosinne Yesusa kaallizaytappe issoy kezidi duufoy dizaso bida. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Nam7ayka issife woxxida; gido attiin Yesusa kaalliza hinkoyssi Phexroosappe pilati woxxidi kaseti duufoy dizaso gakkides. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Duufoza hokki xeellidi ahay izan xaaxettida may7oy xalla dizayssa be7ides; gido attiin gede duufoza giddo gelibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoona geetettiza Phexroosikka iza kaalli gakkidi duufoza giddo gelides; ahay izan xaaxettida carqqay heen dizayssa be7ides. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Yesusa hu7ey xaaxettida carqqay hankko xaaththa carqqatara gidontta dumma harason xaaxetti dizayssa be7ides. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Koyrotti gakkida Yesusa kaallizayssika duufoza giddo geli be7idi ammanides. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Gaasoykka, «Izi hayqoppe dendana bessees» giza maxaafa qaalaa istti buro hassa7ibeettenna. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Hessafe guye nam7atikka simmidi baso baso bida.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Magdale Maarama Yesusa Beyadus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mar 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Magdale Maarama yeekkashe Yesusa duufoppe karera eqqada hokka duufoza giddo xeelladus. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Yesusa ahay dizason booththa may7o may7ida nam7u kiitanchchatappe issoy hu7eson issoy tohoson uttidayta beyadus. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Isttika Maaramo, «Hanne maccassayee! Aazas yeekkay?» gida. Izakka, «Istti ta Godaa efidi awan woththidaakko ta erikke» gadus.<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Iza hinno gaada guye yuuyishin Yesusi eqqidayssa demmadus shin izi Yesusa gididayssa erabeekku. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesusi izo, «Hanne maccassayee! Aazas yeekkay? Qasse oona koyay?» gides; izikka izis atakilte naagizaade misatiin, «Godoo! Ne ekkidaa gidikko ne woththidaso taas yootarkkii! Ta iza taas ekkana» gadus.<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesusi izo, «Maaramee!» gides; izakka gede izakko simmada Ayhudata qaalara, «Erebuune!» gadus; hessa birsheththi, «Astamaaree!» guussa.<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesusi qasse, «Ta buro pude ta Aawaakko kezabeekke; tana bochchofa; gido attiin ne ha7i ta ishataakko baada, ‹Tani ta Aawakkonne intte Aawaakko, ta Xoossaakonne intte Xoossaako kezana gides› gaada isttas yoota» gides. <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Hessa gishshas Magdale Maarama Yesusa kaallizaytakko baada iza Yesusa be7idayssanne izi izis yootidayssa isttas yootadus.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Bana Kaallizaytas Beettides</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mato 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luqa 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />He gallas wogga omars Yesusa kaallizayti Ayhudata daannatas babbidi kare ba bolla gordidi keeththaa giddon shiiqon dishin karey doyettontta Yesusi iza kaallizayti shiiqi diza keeththaa gelides; istta giddon eqqidi, «Saroy inttes gido!» gides. <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Hessa gi simmidi ba kushetanne ba mille istta bessides; iza kaallizaytikka Godaa be7idi keehi ufayettida.<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Hessafe guye qasseka Yesusi istta, «Inttes saroy gido! Ta Aaway tana kiittida mala tanikka inttena kiittays» gides. <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Hessa gi simmidi istta bolla ufu giidi, «Intte Xillo Ayana ekkite. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Intte asa nagara atto giikko isttas atto geetettana; intte asa nagara atto gontta ixxiko qasse isttas atto geetettenna» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mato 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusanne Toomaasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Yesusi bana kaallizaytakko yida wode tammanne nam7atappe issoy Didimoosa geetettiza Toomaasi isttara deenna. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Hessa gishshas hankko Yesusa kaallizayti Toomaasas, «Nuni Godaa be7idos» gida. Toomaasi qasse, «Misimaaren cadettida iza kusheta tani ta ayfera be7ontta dashe, qasseka ta biradhdhe misimaarey gelidason gelththa xeellontta dashenne ta kushe iza mille madunththaan gelththa xeellontta dashe ammanikke» gides.<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Osppun gallassafe guye iza kaallizayti qasseka istti soon dishin, Toomaasikka isttara issife dishin; kareykka gordan dishin Yesusi yiidi istta giddon eqqidi, «Saroy inttes gido!» gides. <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Hessafe guye Toomaasa, «Ne biradhdhe haa ehada ta kusheta beya. Ne kushe haa ehada ta millen gelththa ammana attiin ammanonttaade gidoppa» gides.<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toomaasi, «Ta Godoo! Ta Xoossoo!» gides.<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesusikka Toomaasa, «Neni tana be7ida gishshas ammanadasa; tana be7ontta ammanizayti gidikko istti anjjettidayta» gides.<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Hayssa maxaafaan xaafettontta daro malaatata bana kaallizayta sinththan Yesusi ooththides. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Gido attiin Yesusi izi Masihe, Xoossa naa gididayssa intte erana malanne intte iza sunththan ammanidi de7o demmana mala hayssi xaafettides.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Bana Kaallizaytappe Laappunatas Yesusa Beeto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Hessafe guye Yesusi Xibiraadoose Abba achchan bana kaallizaytas qasseka beettides. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoona geetettiza Phexroosi, Didimoosa geetettiza Toomaasi, Galila Qaana as Natina7eeley, Zabdoosa naytikka Yesusa kaallizaytappe hara nam7atikka wuri issife dishin <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoona geetettiza Phexroosi isttas, «Tani mole oykkana bays» gides; isttika izas, «Nunikka nenara baana» gida. Izara kezi biidi wogolon gelida shin he gallassa omars issi molekka oykkibeettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Luqa 5:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Gadey wontishin Yesusi abba achchan eqqides; iza kaallizayti qasse izi Yesusa gididayssa eribeettenna. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yesusi istta, «Naytoo moley dizee?» gides; isttika, «Aykkoyka baa» gida.<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Izikka, «Giteza wogolozappe ushachcha baggara abban yeggite; intte demmana» gida gishshas giteza abbaa giddo yeggiin daro moley oykettida gishshas giteza molezara goochchana dandaybeettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:6">Luqa 5:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />He wode Yesusa kaallizaytappe izi siiqiza issoy Phexroosas, «Hessi Godaakko!» gides. Simoona geetettiza Phexroosi, «Hessi Godaakko!» giza qaala siyida mala ooso diggofo giidi may7o qaari woththidi kallo diza gishshas heerakka may7o ekki may7idi abbaza giddo guppi gelides. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Yesusa kaalliza hankkoyti qasse biittafe xeetu metire mala haakki diza gishshas moley kumi diza giteza goochchi ekkidi wogolora gakkida. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Istti wogolozappe wodhdhishin moley iza bolla diza bonqo tamanne uketh be7ida.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesusi istta, «Ha7i intte oykkida molezappe ane haa ekki yiite» gides.<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Hessa gishshas Simoona geetettiza Phexroosi wogoloza giddo gelidi 153 wogga gita moleti kumida giteza abbafe gede gade bolla goochchides; hessa mala daro molera diinka gitezi daakettibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Hessafe guye Yesusi istta, «Haa yiidi miite» gides. Izi Godaa Yesusa gididayssa wuri erida gishshas iza kaallizaytappe issaadeyka, «Ne oonee?» gi oychchanaas xalidaadey baa. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesusi yiidi ukeththaanne moleza ekkidi isttas immides.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Yesusi hayqoppe dendiin iza kaallizayti iza beyishin hayssi heedzdzanththo.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Phexroosa Oychchida Oysho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Istti mi giigshin Yesusi Simoona Phexroosa, «Yoona naa Simoonaa! Haytanttafe ne tana aaththa dosay?» gides. Izikka, «Ee ta Godoo! Ta nena dosizayssa nekka eraasa» gides. <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yesusi iza, «Dhammizayta tayta heemma» gides; nam7anththoka, «Yoona naa Simoonaa! Ne tana dosay?» gides; izikka zaaridi, «Ee Godoo! Ta nena dosizayssa nekka eraasa» gides; Yesusi qasseka, «Ta laaqqata naaga» gides.<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Heedzdzanththo, «Yoona naa Simoonaa! Ne tana dosay?» gides. Izi heedzdzanththo, «Ne tana dosay?» gida gishshas Phexroosi mishettidi, «Godoo! Ne ubbaa eraasa; ta nena dosizayssaka ne eraasa» gides; Yesusikka qasseka, «Ta dorsata heemma. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ta nees tumu gays; ne naateththan dashe ne giththe nerkka gixxada ne koyidaso baasashin ne cimmiza wode gidikko neni ne kusheta piddisiin hara asi nena gixisananne ne dosonttaso nena efana» gides. <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesusi iza hessaththo giday Phexroosi ay mala hayqon Xoos bonchchanaakko izas erisanaassa; hessafe guye Phexroosa, «Ne tana kaalla» gides.<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Phexroosi yuushshi xeellidi Yesusi dosizayssi iza kaallishin be7ides; hessaadey kase istti kawo mishin Yesusa hayththako shiiqidi, «Godoo! Nena aaththi immanaadey izi oonee?» gi oychchides. <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Phexroosi iza be7idi, «Godoo! Hayssaadey waanandee?» giidi Yesusa oychchides.<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesusikka izas, «Ta haa simma yaana gakkanawu ta iza paxa woththiko nena aazi gaththidee? Ne tana kaalla» gides.<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Hessa gaason ishata giddon, «Izi hayqo hayqqenna» giza worey laalettides. Gido attiin Yesusi, «Ta yaana gakkanaas paxa daana mala ta koykko nena aazee gaththiday?» gides attiin, «Hayqqaka» gibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />He yo7ota gishshas markkattidaynne xaafiday ha Yesusa kaallizayssa; iza markkateththika tumu gididayssa nuni eroos.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yesusi ooththida hara daroti deettes; taas misatiza mala izi ooththida miishshata ubbaa issi bolla xaafizaakko xaafettida maxaafata hayssi alamey tookkana dandayenna.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>